(786028, 86192, 9089, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo, two things in the photo seem to bother me, first is the uneven lighting in the clouds in the sky, although I like the coloring of the clouds, they are unbalanced giving the photo an unnatural tilt, second is the stuff inside, I like being able to see the gridword through it, but the red? thing in the middle is just distinct enough for me to keep trying to see what it is.</td>', 'Interesting photo, two things in the photo seem to bother me, first is the uneven lighting in the clouds in the sky, although I like the coloring of the clouds, they are unbalanced giving the photo an unnatural tilt, second is the stuff inside, I like being able to see the gridword through it, but the red? thing in the middle is just distinct enough for me to keep trying to see what it is.', '2004-06-30 02:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
