(786126, 85937, 9089, '<td valign="top">I really really want to like this photo.  This truly does meet the extraordinary part of the challenge.  The subject is exceptional, however in saying this, the actual layout leaves a little to be desired.  The purple heart seems to not be as brilliant a purple as it should be.  Include the entire ribbon in the picture and not crop a piece of it off to the left.  Probably my biggest problem in looking at the picture is the white space to the top right.  I would have almost liked to see the reflection of the flag covering the entire photo (or at least would like to see if it would make a difference or not)</td>', 'I really really want to like this photo.  This truly does meet the extraordinary part of the challenge.  The subject is exceptional, however in saying this, the actual layout leaves a little to be desired.  The purple heart seems to not be as brilliant a purple as it should be.  Include the entire ribbon in the picture and not crop a piece of it off to the left.  Probably my biggest problem in looking at the picture is the white space to the top right.  I would have almost liked to see the reflection of the flag covering the entire photo (or at least would like to see if it would make a difference or not)', '2004-06-30 02:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
