(786329, 85389, 9809, '<td valign="top">Cute photo -- I find the grass / plant in the foreground annoying and while you may find your kids extraordinary, they don''t exactly invoke the thought of extraordinary in your casual viewer. This shot certainly does belong in the family photo album. I''m sure they''ll enjoy it more each year they see it, look back, and remember the carefree days of school-free summer.</td>', 'Cute photo -- I find the grass / plant in the foreground annoying and while you may find your kids extraordinary, they don''t exactly invoke the thought of extraordinary in your casual viewer. This shot certainly does belong in the family photo album. I''m sure they''ll enjoy it more each year they see it, look back, and remember the carefree days of school-free summer.', '2004-06-30 05:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(786331, 85603, 19952, '<td valign="top">Wow - what a great idea for this challenge. Might have a bit more impact with higher contrast, but it''s a really nice photo that shows amazing imagination.</td>', 'Wow - what a great idea for this challenge. Might have a bit more impact with higher contrast, but it''s a really nice photo that shows amazing imagination.', '2004-06-30 05:12:38.000000', NULL, 1);
