(786388, 86434, 23643, '<td valign="top">pic not so extordinary Though I like the angle</td>', 'pic not so extordinary Though I like the angle', '2004-06-30 06:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(786389, 86062, 9089, '<td valign="top">Background detracts, especially the rope tied to the cleat on the side of the boat.  I love the colors of the chairs, wish they were centered, and was just them on the dock.</td>', 'Background detracts, especially the rope tied to the cleat on the side of the boat.  I love the colors of the chairs, wish they were centered, and was just them on the dock.', '2004-06-30 06:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(786390, 86407, 9089, '<td valign="top">Knew there would be peacock pics in this challenge, unfortunately what it is standing in front of detracts from it''s beauty, especially the blue wall and the area on the top right corner</td>', 'Knew there would be peacock pics in this challenge, unfortunately what it is standing in front of detracts from it''s beauty, especially the blue wall and the area on the top right corner', '2004-06-30 06:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(786391, 86500, 9089, '<td valign="top">Not very extraordinary in my opinion.  Subject looks like it would have some potential, but the light glaring at me takes all of my viewpoint.</td>', 'Not very extraordinary in my opinion.  Subject looks like it would have some potential, but the light glaring at me takes all of my viewpoint.', '2004-06-30 06:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(786394, 86533, 9089, '<td valign="top">Although a dog balancing a frisbee is far from normal, the angle of the photo does not convey this as well as a lower angle at the dog''s height might show.  Also, the glare on the frisbee hurts the photo as well.</td>', 'Although a dog balancing a frisbee is far from normal, the angle of the photo does not convey this as well as a lower angle at the dog''s height might show.  Also, the glare on the frisbee hurts the photo as well.', '2004-06-30 06:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(786396, 86599, 9089, '<td valign="top">I like the framing around the photo, my only wish is that you could have used a slightly different angle to be able to put the guy on the right third jumping into the photo.  As he is jumping out of the photo, naturally my eyes do as well.</td>', 'I like the framing around the photo, my only wish is that you could have used a slightly different angle to be able to put the guy on the right third jumping into the photo.  As he is jumping out of the photo, naturally my eyes do as well.', '2004-06-30 06:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(786397, 86589, 9089, '<td valign="top">I really wish this picture would be clearer.  Exposure is off, need to check your white balance on it.  Also there seems to be a ton of noise in the photo.</td>', 'I really wish this picture would be clearer.  Exposure is off, need to check your white balance on it.  Also there seems to be a ton of noise in the photo.', '2004-06-30 06:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(786398, 86490, 17233, '<td valign="top">I just love the perspective you have here. Interest all through the image and extremely good exposure. Definately an extraordinary subject (10)</td>', 'I just love the perspective you have here. Interest all through the image and extremely good exposure. Definately an extraordinary subject (10)', '2004-06-30 06:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(786400, 86590, 9089, '<td valign="top">As an evening shot, this leaves me wanting to see nice colors in the sky, but it seems to be gray/smoky on the horizon, and with the smoke coming out of the ship, seems to just blend altogether to be a place I really don''t want to be.</td>', 'As an evening shot, this leaves me wanting to see nice colors in the sky, but it seems to be gray/smoky on the horizon, and with the smoke coming out of the ship, seems to just blend altogether to be a place I really don''t want to be.', '2004-06-30 06:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(786402, 86525, 9089, '<td valign="top">Good subject but a tighter crop on the car would probably help to be able to see some of the the things on the car itself, as it is it just looks like some birds flew over and left a mess on the car.</td>', 'Good subject but a tighter crop on the car would probably help to be able to see some of the the things on the car itself, as it is it just looks like some birds flew over and left a mess on the car.', '2004-06-30 06:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(786403, 85465, 17551, '<td valign="top">superb macro. I would offer suggestions to improve, but i wouldn''t change a thing. 10</td>', 'superb macro. I would offer suggestions to improve, but i wouldn''t change a thing. 10', '2004-06-30 06:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(786404, 85365, 18080, '<td valign="top">nice pun<br/>nice shot<br/>good luck</td>', 'nice punnice shotgood luck', '2004-06-30 06:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(786405, 86751, 17551, '<td valign="top">very cool. 9</td>', 'very cool. 9', '2004-06-30 06:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(786410, 86392, 9089, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, my only minor gripe is that with it being this tall, I have to scroll my screen up and down in order to see it all, so I miss out on being able to just sit back and look at it.  This is especially difficult as the crop is vertical, so it really doesn''t show the picture the way that it really should.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, my only minor gripe is that with it being this tall, I have to scroll my screen up and down in order to see it all, so I miss out on being able to just sit back and look at it.  This is especially difficult as the crop is vertical, so it really doesn''t show the picture the way that it really should.', '2004-06-30 06:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(786411, 86527, 21072, '<td valign="top">Very Original.</td>', 'Very Original.', '2004-06-30 06:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(786413, 86458, 22517, '<td valign="top">Baeutiful picture...</td>', 'Baeutiful picture...', '2004-06-30 06:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(786414, 86612, 17233, '<td valign="top">An incredibly powerful and emotional image. A strong statement about the horrors of humanity and the atrocities we inflict upon each other. I gave this 10 not just for the obvious photographic quality and for meeting the challenge  but also for the sheer impact. It just simply stopped me cold.</td>', 'An incredibly powerful and emotional image. A strong statement about the horrors of humanity and the atrocities we inflict upon each other. I gave this 10 not just for the obvious photographic quality and for meeting the challenge  but also for the sheer impact. It just simply stopped me cold.', '2004-06-30 06:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(786415, 85603, 23016, '<td valign="top">Good idea!<br/>I have only a question: how many photo did you take before taking this one with the word "loud" correct? Did you tied with a longer time of exposure?</td>', 'Good idea!I have only a question: how many photo did you take before taking this one with the word "loud" correct? Did you tied with a longer time of exposure?', '2004-06-30 06:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(786416, 86690, 9089, '<td valign="top">Definitely extraordinary double rainbow.  If it had been my picture, would have cropped out the houses/roofs on the bottom to make it seem totally a nature shot.</td>', 'Definitely extraordinary double rainbow.  If it had been my picture, would have cropped out the houses/roofs on the bottom to make it seem totally a nature shot.', '2004-06-30 06:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(786418, 86211, 9089, '<td valign="top">Just don''t flap in the wind too long.  Unfortunately the tree in the bottom hurts the photo a little, but still above average.</td>', 'Just don''t flap in the wind too long.  Unfortunately the tree in the bottom hurts the photo a little, but still above average.', '2004-06-30 06:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(786419, 85869, 9089, '<td valign="top">I wish I could see the crane lifting up something that looks very heavy or interesting.  The triangle formed by the edge of the roof leading up to the top of the crane really makes the photo balanced.  However the lack of anything really interesting in the photo to make a focus point keeps the photo in just the average range.</td>', 'I wish I could see the crane lifting up something that looks very heavy or interesting.  The triangle formed by the edge of the roof leading up to the top of the crane really makes the photo balanced.  However the lack of anything really interesting in the photo to make a focus point keeps the photo in just the average range.', '2004-06-30 06:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(786420, 86450, 9089, '<td valign="top">The photo seems so close to b&amp;w that you should either make it b&amp;w or try to have some more color in it.  Great capture of the two birds though.</td>', 'The photo seems so close to b&w that you should either make it b&w or try to have some more color in it.  Great capture of the two birds though.', '2004-06-30 06:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(786424, 86577, 9089, '<td valign="top">I love the look of the fish in the water.  The 2 dogs however need better lighting to show them really interested in the fish rather than blending in to the water.  My first thought was ''How''d this lady (don''t know why I said lady, but that was my impression) get a dog and a BEAR (left side dog) together in her backyard."</td>', 'I love the look of the fish in the water.  The 2 dogs however need better lighting to show them really interested in the fish rather than blending in to the water.  My first thought was ''How''d this lady (don''t know why I said lady, but that was my impression) get a dog and a BEAR (left side dog) together in her backyard."', '2004-06-30 06:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(786425, 86598, 9089, '<td valign="top">Clean good picture of the dictionary, however, the only thing extraordinary is the word itself, the photo, although technically almost perfect does not have enough interest to really make it stand out.</td>', 'Clean good picture of the dictionary, however, the only thing extraordinary is the word itself, the photo, although technically almost perfect does not have enough interest to really make it stand out.', '2004-06-30 06:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(786426, 86159, 17233, '<td valign="top">Incredible capture of an extraordinary bird. Great colours and DOF. Well done (10)</td>', 'Incredible capture of an extraordinary bird. Great colours and DOF. Well done (10)', '2004-06-30 07:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(786427, 85389, 9089, '<td valign="top">Love the pictures of the kids, 2 nitpicks on it.  First are the walls, I love the rocks on the right, wish you could have had them so that they were entirely in front of that one instead of the two totally different walls.  Second which is even smaller is that everyone seems to be looking at the camera except the second from the bottom kid.</td>', 'Love the pictures of the kids, 2 nitpicks on it.  First are the walls, I love the rocks on the right, wish you could have had them so that they were entirely in front of that one instead of the two totally different walls.  Second which is even smaller is that everyone seems to be looking at the camera except the second from the bottom kid.', '2004-06-30 07:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(786428, 86567, 9089, '<td valign="top">Wish I knew who this was so that I would agree how extraordinary he is, but without knowing him, all I can say is good picture, although his face does seem to be a little darker than I would want.</td>', 'Wish I knew who this was so that I would agree how extraordinary he is, but without knowing him, all I can say is good picture, although his face does seem to be a little darker than I would want.', '2004-06-30 07:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(786431, 86576, 9089, '<td valign="top">I''ll believe it when I see it :-)  There is so much going on in this photo that I don''t have a clear place to look, and no lines leading me to something really interesting in the photo.  My eyes are going from the wheel of the car to the flowers in the tire to the flagpole to the signs, to the poles to the left to the front of the truck and right off the picture until I start all over again and make my eyes tired.</td>', 'I''ll believe it when I see it :-)  There is so much going on in this photo that I don''t have a clear place to look, and no lines leading me to something really interesting in the photo.  My eyes are going from the wheel of the car to the flowers in the tire to the flagpole to the signs, to the poles to the left to the front of the truck and right off the picture until I start all over again and make my eyes tired.', '2004-06-30 07:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(786433, 86159, 9089, '<td valign="top">WOW, GEORGEOUS, This is just a beautiful pic.  I said I would not say that on pics that I vote high, but this one is just a great capture.  If it does not place in the top 10 I will be very very very surprised.  I will give my one nitpick, in that the far wing on the bird being blurry, blends into the background of the blurry green stuff making it seem like a funky looking wing, but as I said this is a very minor nitpick.</td>', 'WOW, GEORGEOUS, This is just a beautiful pic.  I said I would not say that on pics that I vote high, but this one is just a great capture.  If it does not place in the top 10 I will be very very very surprised.  I will give my one nitpick, in that the far wing on the bird being blurry, blends into the background of the blurry green stuff making it seem like a funky looking wing, but as I said this is a very minor nitpick.', '2004-06-30 07:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(786435, 86651, 9089, '<td valign="top">The glare on the label hurts me from seeing and truly appreciating the champagne.</td>', 'The glare on the label hurts me from seeing and truly appreciating the champagne.', '2004-06-30 07:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
