(787030, 86629, 13136, '<td valign="top">The color is interesting. Was it that color in real life or did you tweak the hue? The sign in the middle just begs for people to stare at it and try to figure out what is on it (I finally did after looking for a while). Might have worked better zoomed back a bit to see the light patters on the ceiling instead of the bricks below.</td>', 'The color is interesting. Was it that color in real life or did you tweak the hue? The sign in the middle just begs for people to stare at it and try to figure out what is on it (I finally did after looking for a while). Might have worked better zoomed back a bit to see the light patters on the ceiling instead of the bricks below.', '2004-06-30 12:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(787033, 85581, 18197, '<td valign="top">Good idea. I think, however, that the contrast is too high or possibly that it is over leveled. The whites are blown out and the black is too. This makes the image look flat. There is obviously some depth to the photo and it would be better in my opinion to celebrate the depth and texture rather than eliminate it.</td>', 'Good idea. I think, however, that the contrast is too high or possibly that it is over leveled. The whites are blown out and the black is too. This makes the image look flat. There is obviously some depth to the photo and it would be better in my opinion to celebrate the depth and texture rather than eliminate it.', '2004-06-30 12:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
