(787101, 86473, 18517, '<td valign="top">I''ve been experimenting with my laser pointer and 1lb bag of marbles with similar results... nice setup.</td>', 'I''ve been experimenting with my laser pointer and 1lb bag of marbles with similar results... nice setup.', '2004-06-30 13:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(787102, 86601, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like the color and crystaline structure. If I look at it from a distance, it''s like looking up at the sun through fall folliage. To me though, the overall effect is noisy. I think you tried to help with the title, but it seems like you tried to stretch a so so photo with the title. Lots of threads talk about how the photo should stand alone and that the title won''t make the photo. If I find myself agonizing too much over a title I try to stop short and ask myself whether the photo is capable of standing on its own.</td>', 'I like the color and crystaline structure. If I look at it from a distance, it''s like looking up at the sun through fall folliage. To me though, the overall effect is noisy. I think you tried to help with the title, but it seems like you tried to stretch a so so photo with the title. Lots of threads talk about how the photo should stand alone and that the title won''t make the photo. If I find myself agonizing too much over a title I try to stop short and ask myself whether the photo is capable of standing on its own.', '2004-06-30 13:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(787109, 86135, 18197, '<td valign="top">You may get this comment a lot, but bigger is usually better if the resolution will stand it. Suggest maxing the dimensions on a square comp to provide more (and hopefully more interesting) detail.</td>', 'You may get this comment a lot, but bigger is usually better if the resolution will stand it. Suggest maxing the dimensions on a square comp to provide more (and hopefully more interesting) detail.', '2004-06-30 13:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
