(787163, 86460, 13136, '<td valign="top">It looks like the contrast was turned up so high as to make everything grainy. It might have been better to just let the light on the web be the focus.</td>', 'It looks like the contrast was turned up so high as to make everything grainy. It might have been better to just let the light on the web be the focus.', '2004-06-30 13:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(787170, 86722, 22825, '<td valign="top">A very neat abstract composition.  I just wish I could figure out what I was looking at.</td>', 'A very neat abstract composition.  I just wish I could figure out what I was looking at.', '2004-06-30 13:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(787172, 86458, 2764, '<td valign="top">oh my. this is lovely.  What a perfect scene.  the contrast between the straight lines (square) and the curved is wonderful. the pink side of the square repeats the pink flowers, the yellow in the center anchors each halp in the middle.  The muted colors work well to enhance the Zen ness of the image.  So very nice.  Not quite sharp enough for a ribbon, you''ll have to settle for a top ten.</td>', 'oh my. this is lovely.  What a perfect scene.  the contrast between the straight lines (square) and the curved is wonderful. the pink side of the square repeats the pink flowers, the yellow in the center anchors each halp in the middle.  The muted colors work well to enhance the Zen ness of the image.  So very nice.  Not quite sharp enough for a ribbon, you''ll have to settle for a top ten.', '2004-06-30 13:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(787174, 86651, 13136, '<td valign="top">Probably should not have cropped the bottoms of the two strawberries. I''m spending too much time trying to figure out what I am seeing reflected in the glass. Maybe blurr it out a bit so it''s less distinctive?</td>', 'Probably should not have cropped the bottoms of the two strawberries. I''m spending too much time trying to figure out what I am seeing reflected in the glass. Maybe blurr it out a bit so it''s less distinctive?', '2004-06-30 13:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(787180, 86419, 13136, '<td valign="top">Good stop action. I think you composed and cropped it just right (rule of thirds). The two light sposts below the column are distracting, but not too much.</td>', 'Good stop action. I think you composed and cropped it just right (rule of thirds). The two light sposts below the column are distracting, but not too much.', '2004-06-30 13:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(787181, 86451, 16636, '<td valign="top">nicely composed</td>', 'nicely composed', '2004-06-30 13:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(787186, 85918, 13136, '<td valign="top">Too fuzzy and indistinct to be of much interest. The rows of lights along the top make it look like you are speeding down a tunnel, interesting effect. Oh, now I see. Taken through glass (windshield?).</td>', 'Too fuzzy and indistinct to be of much interest. The rows of lights along the top make it look like you are speeding down a tunnel, interesting effect. Oh, now I see. Taken through glass (windshield?).', '2004-06-30 13:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(787189, 86460, 2764, '<td valign="top">Happy Halloween.  The contrast between the sharply focused web and the completly out of focus background is very nice/  The over processed look works well here, even the grainy background.  It is a sylized image of a spider web, you can than the spider for the wonderful repeating patterns in the lines.  You can thiank yourself for mimicking the radiating pattern in the leaves of the background.   I like the way the image reads from top left to lower right and the center of the web draws the eye back into the scene.</td>', 'Happy Halloween.  The contrast between the sharply focused web and the completly out of focus background is very nice/  The over processed look works well here, even the grainy background.  It is a sylized image of a spider web, you can than the spider for the wonderful repeating patterns in the lines.  You can thiank yourself for mimicking the radiating pattern in the leaves of the background.   I like the way the image reads from top left to lower right and the center of the web draws the eye back into the scene.', '2004-06-30 13:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(787191, 85863, 22825, '<td valign="top">Ouch!  Incredible capture, just wish things were a bit more or less in focus.  I wonder what it would have looked like with a longer exposure, like 1/3s, or a shorter exposure to freeze time.  This just looks blurry.  Again, incredible capture, though.  6</td>', 'Ouch!  Incredible capture, just wish things were a bit more or less in focus.  I wonder what it would have looked like with a longer exposure, like 1/3s, or a shorter exposure to freeze time.  This just looks blurry.  Again, incredible capture, though.  6', '2004-06-30 13:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(787193, 86605, 16636, '<td valign="top">I think the image dosen''t need such a harsh crop, more is better in this case.</td>', 'I think the image dosen''t need such a harsh crop, more is better in this case.', '2004-06-30 13:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(787195, 86598, 18197, '<td valign="top">Lighting does a nice job of creating depth and texture. Levels are good. So''s contrast. Shallow DoF is a bit distracting. A little less shallow might have been better.</td>', 'Lighting does a nice job of creating depth and texture. Levels are good. So''s contrast. Shallow DoF is a bit distracting. A little less shallow might have been better.', '2004-06-30 13:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(787198, 85778, 22825, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photograph.  My only complaint is that the long exposure made the woman look very blurry, which I find distracting.  If you didn''t know them, though, I suppose it would have been rude to ask them to stay still. :)  9</td>', 'Beautiful photograph.  My only complaint is that the long exposure made the woman look very blurry, which I find distracting.  If you didn''t know them, though, I suppose it would have been rude to ask them to stay still. :)  9', '2004-06-30 13:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(787199, 86408, 18197, '<td valign="top">I find this image disturbing. I think it''s the eye that is in focus and seemingly without movement. Nice capture.</td>', 'I find this image disturbing. I think it''s the eye that is in focus and seemingly without movement. Nice capture.', '2004-06-30 13:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(787201, 86562, 23656, '<td valign="top">The horizon could be straighter...</td>', 'The horizon could be straighter...', '2004-06-30 13:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(787202, 86129, 16241, '<td valign="top">very nice</td>', 'very nice', '2004-06-30 13:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(787204, 85365, 18197, '<td valign="top">It is an unusual subject and you had to be there at just the right time. What was the truck carrying, good intentions?</td>', 'It is an unusual subject and you had to be there at just the right time. What was the truck carrying, good intentions?', '2004-06-30 13:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(787208, 86019, 16241, '<td valign="top">E</td>', 'E', '2004-06-30 13:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(787209, 86620, 16241, '<td valign="top">if you say so.. lol  good photo</td>', 'if you say so.. lol  good photo', '2004-06-30 13:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(787210, 86425, 16241, '<td valign="top">it sure is........ i like goats</td>', 'it sure is........ i like goats', '2004-06-30 13:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(787216, 85690, 23146, '<td valign="top">Nice picture</td>', 'Nice picture', '2004-06-30 13:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(787217, 86754, 18197, '<td valign="top">Good subject. Love the gray scale. But the overall photo is too dark and the subject doesn''t fill enough of the frame to do it justice.</td>', 'Good subject. Love the gray scale. But the overall photo is too dark and the subject doesn''t fill enough of the frame to do it justice.', '2004-06-30 13:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(787218, 86393, 16241, '<td valign="top">nice and sharp</td>', 'nice and sharp', '2004-06-30 13:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(787220, 86551, 21627, '<td valign="top">Looks like it may be a bit over sharpened.</td>', 'Looks like it may be a bit over sharpened.', '2004-06-30 13:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(787221, 85581, 16241, '<td valign="top">nice and sharp</td>', 'nice and sharp', '2004-06-30 13:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(787222, 86133, 23656, '<td valign="top">Ahh... San Francisco!  Great shot of a old boat!</td>', 'Ahh... San Francisco!  Great shot of a old boat!', '2004-06-30 13:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(787223, 85911, 16241, '<td valign="top">looks like tonsils!  nice colors</td>', 'looks like tonsils!  nice colors', '2004-06-30 14:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(787225, 86332, 16241, '<td valign="top">looks like he was pasted afterwards?  unusual for sure</td>', 'looks like he was pasted afterwards?  unusual for sure', '2004-06-30 14:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(787227, 86684, 13136, '<td valign="top">Nice work on the clouds, but for some reason, the house looks out of focus. I like the use of negative space, but feel the green could be a bit lighter with more definition. Might just be a result of having to compress the shot for the challenge.</td>', 'Nice work on the clouds, but for some reason, the house looks out of focus. I like the use of negative space, but feel the green could be a bit lighter with more definition. Might just be a result of having to compress the shot for the challenge.', '2004-06-30 14:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(787228, 86635, 13136, '<td valign="top">With egg sacks too. I like the angle of this shot. Somehow the lighting works fairly well also although there is a bit of blurr top left of spider.</td>', 'With egg sacks too. I like the angle of this shot. Somehow the lighting works fairly well also although there is a bit of blurr top left of spider.', '2004-06-30 14:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(787230, 86539, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice image. Good focus and levels. Like the subject even if it''s a little disturbing.  It might be improved by cropping about 15% off the left side giving a square or nearly square image. And I would recommend maxing the dimensions to 640 pixels. Larger photos show more detail, look better as thumbnails, and tend to score higher. Good capture and good luck in the voting. It''s a worthy image.</td>', 'Nice image. Good focus and levels. Like the subject even if it''s a little disturbing.  It might be improved by cropping about 15% off the left side giving a square or nearly square image. And I would recommend maxing the dimensions to 640 pixels. Larger photos show more detail, look better as thumbnails, and tend to score higher. Good capture and good luck in the voting. It''s a worthy image.', '2004-06-30 14:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(787234, 86475, 18197, '<td valign="top">Very pleasant picture, nicely composed. Colors are soothing. Levels and contrast are good. These led me to score it higher than the subject (not that extraordinary) will be scored by oithers.</td>', 'Very pleasant picture, nicely composed. Colors are soothing. Levels and contrast are good. These led me to score it higher than the subject (not that extraordinary) will be scored by oithers.', '2004-06-30 14:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(787237, 86695, 16636, '<td valign="top">cool...</td>', 'cool...', '2004-06-30 14:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(787238, 86647, 13136, '<td valign="top">This shot looks kind of washed out. Maybe a little increase in the bottom levels to darken the silhouettes in the back and add more texture/color to the sky/clouds?</td>', 'This shot looks kind of washed out. Maybe a little increase in the bottom levels to darken the silhouettes in the back and add more texture/color to the sky/clouds?', '2004-06-30 14:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(787239, 85389, 16636, '<td valign="top">lovelly natural photo to be proud of...</td>', 'lovelly natural photo to be proud of...', '2004-06-30 14:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(787241, 86502, 13136, '<td valign="top">I like the effect achieved by use of the curtains. Not sure what, if anything, would make this better.</td>', 'I like the effect achieved by use of the curtains. Not sure what, if anything, would make this better.', '2004-06-30 14:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(787244, 86714, 13136, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure that the person in the front helps this shot or distracts. Seems like the whole globe should be in the picture. Good color, lighting and contrast.</td>', 'I''m not sure that the person in the front helps this shot or distracts. Seems like the whole globe should be in the picture. Good color, lighting and contrast.', '2004-06-30 14:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(787245, 86612, 20115, '<td valign="top">Hope this is makeup.</td>', 'Hope this is makeup.', '2004-06-30 14:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(787247, 86131, 13136, '<td valign="top">Might have tried a tighter DOF and sharper focus on the boys to blur the background. Good composition and lighting, gives the feel of being IN the forest.</td>', 'Might have tried a tighter DOF and sharper focus on the boys to blur the background. Good composition and lighting, gives the feel of being IN the forest.', '2004-06-30 14:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(787250, 85428, 13136, '<td valign="top">Sorry, the tight DOF and grain don''t work for me on this shot. Seems the center of the flower should be in focus as well. Everything looks like it was splattered with paint.</td>', 'Sorry, the tight DOF and grain don''t work for me on this shot. Seems the center of the flower should be in focus as well. Everything looks like it was splattered with paint.', '2004-06-30 14:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(787252, 86495, 18197, '<td valign="top">This must have been a very difficult shot. Butterflies tend not to stand still. It looks a little grainy -- wonder if Neat Image or some such would have helped. The image would be improved by a sharper focus on the wings ... probably just not possible due to movement. If we could have used advanced editing, I might have tried blurring the background a bit more. As is, the DoF is great!</td>', 'This must have been a very difficult shot. Butterflies tend not to stand still. It looks a little grainy -- wonder if Neat Image or some such would have helped. The image would be improved by a sharper focus on the wings ... probably just not possible due to movement. If we could have used advanced editing, I might have tried blurring the background a bit more. As is, the DoF is great!', '2004-06-30 14:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(787254, 85692, 13136, '<td valign="top">Just me, but I would have cropped the top half of the picture and made this into a panoramic feel shot.  Good crisp colors and definition of the orange/red part is lessened by the softness of the top.</td>', 'Just me, but I would have cropped the top half of the picture and made this into a panoramic feel shot.  Good crisp colors and definition of the orange/red part is lessened by the softness of the top.', '2004-06-30 14:18:52.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(787255, 86601, 8054, '<td valign="top">Even with the title explanation, I do not understand what it is I am looking at other than a brownish blob, sorry.<br/> <br/>Additional comments:<br/>Now that I know what it is I am viewing, I can barely make out individual crystals of sugar. I still see evidence of compression and/or grain and noise from a high ISO setting.</td>', 'Even with the title explanation, I do not understand what it is I am looking at other than a brownish blob, sorry. Additional comments:Now that I know what it is I am viewing, I can barely make out individual crystals of sugar. I still see evidence of compression and/or grain and noise from a high ISO setting.', '2004-06-30 14:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(787257, 86721, 13136, '<td valign="top">Good catch to stop the action and motion blur the stationary. Too bad the sunlight wasn''t on your side of the track as the rider and his bike look a bit murky. I like the crop.</td>', 'Good catch to stop the action and motion blur the stationary. Too bad the sunlight wasn''t on your side of the track as the rider and his bike look a bit murky. I like the crop.', '2004-06-30 14:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(787258, 86465, 8054, '<td valign="top">I can''t tell that this is in fact the sixth floor of the building. Would have helped to show more or some indicator that it is the sixth floor. Otherwise, I just see a top of a building with vines and it could be the second or even first floor.</td>', 'I can''t tell that this is in fact the sixth floor of the building. Would have helped to show more or some indicator that it is the sixth floor. Otherwise, I just see a top of a building with vines and it could be the second or even first floor.', '2004-06-30 14:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(787262, 86468, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice composition for the bee. Blends in a bit with the flower colors. Not you can do about where the bee lands. :)</td>', 'Nice composition for the bee. Blends in a bit with the flower colors. Not you can do about where the bee lands. :)', '2004-06-30 14:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(787265, 85465, 23146, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture, focus, color and everything are wonderful</td>', 'Very nice picture, focus, color and everything are wonderful', '2004-06-30 14:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(787266, 85654, 23146, '<td valign="top">very good picture and nice idea</td>', 'very good picture and nice idea', '2004-06-30 14:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(787269, 86623, 9089, '<td valign="top">Beautiful rose, the green leaf on the left side would be better had it been bent down so it wasn''t touching the flower itself.</td>', 'Beautiful rose, the green leaf on the left side would be better had it been bent down so it wasn''t touching the flower itself.', '2004-06-30 14:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(787270, 86376, 13136, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea and unique object in the front, but this shot just doesn''t do anything for me. Sorry. Maybe if the figures were lit from the object instead of another source above?</td>', 'Interesting idea and unique object in the front, but this shot just doesn''t do anything for me. Sorry. Maybe if the figures were lit from the object instead of another source above?', '2004-06-30 14:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(787271, 86419, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like the way the droplet focus light and therefore focuses the background behind it. Wonderfully captured. Probably unavoidable, but the two white streaks on the bottom third of the image distact a bit. Consider using advanced editing to prepare this as a print.</td>', 'I like the way the droplet focus light and therefore focuses the background behind it. Wonderfully captured. Probably unavoidable, but the two white streaks on the bottom third of the image distact a bit. Consider using advanced editing to prepare this as a print.', '2004-06-30 14:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(787272, 86401, 9089, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous, just a tad tighter crop up on the top right corner to get rid of the yellow, would make it better, or move the crop out a bit to show more of it.  As it is, it looks a bit uneven with the yellow on the top left corner.</td>', 'Gorgeous, just a tad tighter crop up on the top right corner to get rid of the yellow, would make it better, or move the crop out a bit to show more of it.  As it is, it looks a bit uneven with the yellow on the top left corner.', '2004-06-30 14:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(787274, 86143, 13136, '<td valign="top">That''s one ugly bird. Good closeup work. The lighting brings out the white of the feathers well.</td>', 'That''s one ugly bird. Good closeup work. The lighting brings out the white of the feathers well.', '2004-06-30 14:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(787277, 86458, 13136, '<td valign="top">Good composition and lighting. Cropping it so there is slightly more of the real than the reflection was a good choice.</td>', 'Good composition and lighting. Cropping it so there is slightly more of the real than the reflection was a good choice.', '2004-06-30 14:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(787279, 86549, 22180, '<td valign="top">A nice catch, but technically poor.</td>', 'A nice catch, but technically poor.', '2004-06-30 14:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(787281, 85428, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like the image. The comp is good but possibly a bit too centered. Colors are great. The image seems a little noisy to me. Could you clean it up with Neat Image or some such? I actually like he noise on the petals but the noise on the blue is a bit distracting. Another possibility would be to trim a bit off the left ... eliminate the blue and adjust the over centered comp all in one go. Still a beautiful image and worthy of recognition. Good luck.</td>', 'I like the image. The comp is good but possibly a bit too centered. Colors are great. The image seems a little noisy to me. Could you clean it up with Neat Image or some such? I actually like he noise on the petals but the noise on the blue is a bit distracting. Another possibility would be to trim a bit off the left ... eliminate the blue and adjust the over centered comp all in one go. Still a beautiful image and worthy of recognition. Good luck.', '2004-06-30 14:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(787285, 85508, 23146, '<td valign="top">very lovely picture</td>', 'very lovely picture', '2004-06-30 14:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(787286, 86019, 13136, '<td valign="top">Perris Lake, CA? Good shot for the "Advertisement" challenge. Not really anything "Extraordinary" though.</td>', 'Perris Lake, CA? Good shot for the "Advertisement" challenge. Not really anything "Extraordinary" though.', '2004-06-30 14:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(787289, 86524, 13136, '<td valign="top">Not a lot of detail in this shot. Good catch of the terminus between light and dark. May have worked better cropping off  lots of bottom and some top to make into a panoramic feel shot.</td>', 'Not a lot of detail in this shot. Good catch of the terminus between light and dark. May have worked better cropping off  lots of bottom and some top to make into a panoramic feel shot.', '2004-06-30 14:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(787291, 86527, 9089, '<td valign="top">I think a tighter crop would help this, I know you were trying to get the whole mug into the shot, however, with it being so far out of focus, my eyes feel like they are crossing trying to look at it.</td>', 'I think a tighter crop would help this, I know you were trying to get the whole mug into the shot, however, with it being so far out of focus, my eyes feel like they are crossing trying to look at it.', '2004-06-30 14:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(787292, 86578, 13136, '<td valign="top">Nice closeup and use of DOF. Makes me want to see the bug closer up.</td>', 'Nice closeup and use of DOF. Makes me want to see the bug closer up.', '2004-06-30 14:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(787293, 86689, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice focus and light. Would of liked the bottom cropped tighter to remove the thumb. :) Good entry.</td>', 'Nice focus and light. Would of liked the bottom cropped tighter to remove the thumb. :) Good entry.', '2004-06-30 14:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(787294, 86442, 3461, '<td valign="top">I would give it a higher score if it were in focus better. Very nice mood though.</td>', 'I would give it a higher score if it were in focus better. Very nice mood though.', '2004-06-30 14:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(787295, 86063, 22392, '<td valign="top">wow. what happened here?</td>', 'wow. what happened here?', '2004-06-30 14:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(787297, 86551, 327, '<td valign="top">Really bright sunshine. Might want to try a UV or umbrella to shield the strong light if not changing your exposure. Terrible wind must of gone by that tree. Looks like it was healthy too.</td>', 'Really bright sunshine. Might want to try a UV or umbrella to shield the strong light if not changing your exposure. Terrible wind must of gone by that tree. Looks like it was healthy too.', '2004-06-30 14:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(787298, 86497, 23146, '<td valign="top">I think this picture could be better without  flash, anyway it´s good idea</td>', 'I think this picture could be better without  flash, anyway it´s good idea', '2004-06-30 14:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(787299, 86602, 18197, '<td valign="top">LOVE the expression on the bug. Bet that took a few tries! The hue and saturation of the bug and the buds is very similar. I lose some of the bug. Not much you can do about it however. Hope this does well. good luck.</td>', 'LOVE the expression on the bug. Bet that took a few tries! The hue and saturation of the bug and the buds is very similar. I lose some of the bug. Not much you can do about it however. Hope this does well. good luck.', '2004-06-30 14:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(787302, 86666, 327, '<td valign="top">Most of this shot is really fantastic. There are some hot spots of sunshine and his face/eye are in the shade and hard to see. I do love the over all idea.</td>', 'Most of this shot is really fantastic. There are some hot spots of sunshine and his face/eye are in the shade and hard to see. I do love the over all idea.', '2004-06-30 14:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(787303, 86564, 327, '<td valign="top">9 Just lovely. Congrats.</td>', '9 Just lovely. Congrats.', '2004-06-30 14:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(787305, 86631, 327, '<td valign="top">You can now wisk the shell and egg at the same time. LOL Very clever. Good creative idea. 9</td>', 'You can now wisk the shell and egg at the same time. LOL Very clever. Good creative idea. 9', '2004-06-30 14:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(787306, 86159, 327, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Congrats.</td>', 'Nicely done. Congrats.', '2004-06-30 14:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(787307, 86742, 22392, '<td valign="top">this is the only flower picture in this challenge i am gonna rate higher than 5. The title helps, but these ARE extraordinary. 7</td>', 'this is the only flower picture in this challenge i am gonna rate higher than 5. The title helps, but these ARE extraordinary. 7', '2004-06-30 14:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(787308, 85717, 9089, '<td valign="top">White balance seems to be a little off, too much blueish cast, almost makes the baby look like it is not breathing.</td>', 'White balance seems to be a little off, too much blueish cast, almost makes the baby look like it is not breathing.', '2004-06-30 14:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(787310, 86317, 327, '<td valign="top">9 Creative, unique.</td>', '9 Creative, unique.', '2004-06-30 14:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(787311, 86595, 9089, '<td valign="top">Good catch, although you probably didn''t have much time on this shot, would prefer it with the head toward the camera, and then the head and the lizard in focus.</td>', 'Good catch, although you probably didn''t have much time on this shot, would prefer it with the head toward the camera, and then the head and the lizard in focus.', '2004-06-30 14:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(787312, 85368, 327, '<td valign="top">Just the wire/branch running across the face....8 very nice black and white, focus is really nice.</td>', 'Just the wire/branch running across the face....8 very nice black and white, focus is really nice.', '2004-06-30 14:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
