(787623, 86488, 7322, '<td valign="top">This looks familiar--like something from the Serendipity challenge. I like it all except I would rather see the feathers that are cropped at the lower edge of the frame a bit more off to the left of the frame, or better yet, eliminated entirely, to balance out the composition a bit. The way they are placed here, the whole thing seems to be spilling off the lower edge of the frame instead of being firmly grounded.</td>', 'This looks familiar--like something from the Serendipity challenge. I like it all except I would rather see the feathers that are cropped at the lower edge of the frame a bit more off to the left of the frame, or better yet, eliminated entirely, to balance out the composition a bit. The way they are placed here, the whole thing seems to be spilling off the lower edge of the frame instead of being firmly grounded.', '2004-06-30 16:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
