(787631, 86428, 15212, '<td valign="top">just a little more editing would have gotten rid of all detail in the background and made this a great shot! As is, it is pretty good and a great effort in a tough challenge. 8</td>', 'just a little more editing would have gotten rid of all detail in the background and made this a great shot! As is, it is pretty good and a great effort in a tough challenge. 8', '2004-06-30 16:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
