(787633, 86548, 22781, '<td valign="top">That is extraordinary for most of us, but looks like a sunset when you take a picture of it...<br/>Are you that north that it stayes light 24hrs a day? Would love to see that once, must be a very strange experience (8)</td>', 'That is extraordinary for most of us, but looks like a sunset when you take a picture of it...Are you that north that it stayes light 24hrs a day? Would love to see that once, must be a very strange experience (8)', '2004-06-30 16:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(787634, 86405, 7322, '<td valign="top">I like the idea. I''m not sure about the composition. Maybe if the subject was placed more off-center? Also, a more vibrantly colored projection would have separated the sillouhette from the background more effectively.</td>', 'I like the idea. I''m not sure about the composition. Maybe if the subject was placed more off-center? Also, a more vibrantly colored projection would have separated the sillouhette from the background more effectively.', '2004-06-30 16:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
