(788010, 85756, 22922, '<td valign="top">While I personally think Hawaii is extraordinary, this picture is pretty bland.  Should have been in color, for one thing, and doesn''t actually have anything extraordinary about it.</td>', 'While I personally think Hawaii is extraordinary, this picture is pretty bland.  Should have been in color, for one thing, and doesn''t actually have anything extraordinary about it.', '2004-06-30 19:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(788017, 85708, 22922, '<td valign="top">This is a poorly done image of a fairly boring subject.  While the title should fit the image, you shouldn''t need the title to explain the image.</td>', 'This is a poorly done image of a fairly boring subject.  While the title should fit the image, you shouldn''t need the title to explain the image.', '2004-06-30 19:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(788022, 86515, 22922, '<td valign="top">Not a great photo, but surely an interesting story of how you got on eye level here.  Composition is nice but the colors are dreary and dark, photo is grainy and slightly out of focus.</td>', 'Not a great photo, but surely an interesting story of how you got on eye level here.  Composition is nice but the colors are dreary and dark, photo is grainy and slightly out of focus.', '2004-06-30 19:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(788024, 86690, 22922, '<td valign="top">Definitely meets the challenge, though I''m sure you''ll get some negative nellies asking for a validation.  Exceptional shot.</td>', 'Definitely meets the challenge, though I''m sure you''ll get some negative nellies asking for a validation.  Exceptional shot.', '2004-06-30 19:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(788029, 86431, 22922, '<td valign="top">I dunno, looks like a plain ''ol mountain to me, and not a great photo of it either.  Top is washed out and the middle is out of focus.  Not enough contrast either, there''s not really anything to look at in this image.</td>', 'I dunno, looks like a plain ''ol mountain to me, and not a great photo of it either.  Top is washed out and the middle is out of focus.  Not enough contrast either, there''s not really anything to look at in this image.', '2004-06-30 19:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(788032, 86525, 22922, '<td valign="top">Fun car, image is a bit pixelated (maybe over-sharpened?) and I would try to clone out the sliver car in the background if you make prints of this. Nice entry.</td>', 'Fun car, image is a bit pixelated (maybe over-sharpened?) and I would try to clone out the sliver car in the background if you make prints of this. Nice entry.', '2004-06-30 19:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(788036, 86435, 22922, '<td valign="top">Not great.  Lots of images of pretty areas in this challenge, this one has washed out areas and the focal point is too dark, not fully in focus and not clearly contrasted.  A closer crop (lose the tourists) might help.</td>', 'Not great.  Lots of images of pretty areas in this challenge, this one has washed out areas and the focal point is too dark, not fully in focus and not clearly contrasted.  A closer crop (lose the tourists) might help.', '2004-06-30 19:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(788037, 86332, 22922, '<td valign="top">A bit overexposed, and out of focus, but a great challenge entry nonethless. A closer crop might have helped here.</td>', 'A bit overexposed, and out of focus, but a great challenge entry nonethless. A closer crop might have helped here.', '2004-06-30 19:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(788040, 86234, 22922, '<td valign="top">What''s with the golf cart?? Crop out the bottom inch and about a half inch of the top, then you''ll have a keeper.</td>', 'What''s with the golf cart?? Crop out the bottom inch and about a half inch of the top, then you''ll have a keeper.', '2004-06-30 19:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(788041, 86612, 22922, '<td valign="top">I hope that''s not real, or if it is, that you got a waiver to run this image.  An unpleasantly ordinary occurence, which should be extraordinary.</td>', 'I hope that''s not real, or if it is, that you got a waiver to run this image.  An unpleasantly ordinary occurence, which should be extraordinary.', '2004-06-30 19:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(788044, 86503, 22922, '<td valign="top">Well, it''s pretty innuendous, but not that extraordinary. Pretty shot, iffy composition.</td>', 'Well, it''s pretty innuendous, but not that extraordinary. Pretty shot, iffy composition.', '2004-06-30 19:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(788045, 86632, 8054, '<td valign="top">I do not see any reference to the country of Norway in the photo. What I do see: water, mud, plants, other odd bits and reflections of the sky and sun. Maybe the photo was taken in Norway but that is not apparent to me.</td>', 'I do not see any reference to the country of Norway in the photo. What I do see: water, mud, plants, other odd bits and reflections of the sky and sun. Maybe the photo was taken in Norway but that is not apparent to me.', '2004-06-30 19:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(788046, 85518, 22922, '<td valign="top">Not extraordinary, not a great shot.  Too dark and seems last-minute.</td>', 'Not extraordinary, not a great shot.  Too dark and seems last-minute.', '2004-06-30 19:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(788048, 85807, 22922, '<td valign="top">Ok, it took me too long to figure out what this showed.  Too much busy background, but a nice idea. Try it on a solid background.</td>', 'Ok, it took me too long to figure out what this showed.  Too much busy background, but a nice idea. Try it on a solid background.', '2004-06-30 19:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(788049, 86605, 8054, '<td valign="top">This firebox has seen some better days. I guess it''s used to report a fire but I don''t know as I''ve never seen one before. It feels a bit too centered and would definitely look better with a shallow DOF to blur the background.</td>', 'This firebox has seen some better days. I guess it''s used to report a fire but I don''t know as I''ve never seen one before. It feels a bit too centered and would definitely look better with a shallow DOF to blur the background.', '2004-06-30 19:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(788051, 86521, 22922, '<td valign="top">nice.</td>', 'nice.', '2004-06-30 19:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(788053, 86428, 22922, '<td valign="top">Poorly executed, should have had palms up to suggest throwing, right now it''s just cards on a table.</td>', 'Poorly executed, should have had palms up to suggest throwing, right now it''s just cards on a table.', '2004-06-30 19:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(788055, 86567, 16126, '<td valign="top">If this had been for the portrait challenge, it would have been my top pick! For this challenge, I don''t know who Zanardi is so I don''t see anything extraordinary here (except an extraordinary good portrait :-)</td>', 'If this had been for the portrait challenge, it would have been my top pick! For this challenge, I don''t know who Zanardi is so I don''t see anything extraordinary here (except an extraordinary good portrait :-)', '2004-06-30 19:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(788056, 85664, 22922, '<td valign="top">Eeek! Too Bright, Too Sharp. Not a great challenge entry.</td>', 'Eeek! Too Bright, Too Sharp. Not a great challenge entry.', '2004-06-30 19:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(788057, 86742, 8054, '<td valign="top">Very vibrant colors and the fact that they mimick pom-poms is nice. Border feels a bit weighty and thick.</td>', 'Very vibrant colors and the fact that they mimick pom-poms is nice. Border feels a bit weighty and thick.', '2004-06-30 19:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(788058, 86123, 22922, '<td valign="top">Why extraordinary? Colors are too saturated, end up losing contrast.  Nowhere to focus in the shot.</td>', 'Why extraordinary? Colors are too saturated, end up losing contrast.  Nowhere to focus in the shot.', '2004-06-30 19:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(788059, 85908, 22922, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  Nice use of illusion. Really fake looking skull :)</td>', 'Interesting.  Nice use of illusion. Really fake looking skull :)', '2004-06-30 19:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(788062, 85836, 22922, '<td valign="top">No kidding :) How many shots did you take? Luck counts, in my opinion, a solid 8 for extraordinary luck!</td>', 'No kidding :) How many shots did you take? Luck counts, in my opinion, a solid 8 for extraordinary luck!', '2004-06-30 19:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(788064, 85797, 22922, '<td valign="top">Not a very interesting shot, focus is off, blue is very saturated, doesn''t say "extraordinary" without your title.</td>', 'Not a very interesting shot, focus is off, blue is very saturated, doesn''t say "extraordinary" without your title.', '2004-06-30 19:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(788065, 86468, 22922, '<td valign="top">Looks like a plain ''ol bee to me. Too dark as well.</td>', 'Looks like a plain ''ol bee to me. Too dark as well.', '2004-06-30 19:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(788067, 85869, 22922, '<td valign="top">BOOOORING image..  Crop the top 2 inches or so out, why all the blue space? Too Bright, not enough detail.</td>', 'BOOOORING image..  Crop the top 2 inches or so out, why all the blue space? Too Bright, not enough detail.', '2004-06-30 19:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(788070, 86590, 22922, '<td valign="top">OK, WAY too dark.  WAY WAY too dark.  I had to wash out my entire screen to even figure out what your picture was of.  It looks like a snatshot regardless.</td>', 'OK, WAY too dark.  WAY WAY too dark.  I had to wash out my entire screen to even figure out what your picture was of.  It looks like a snatshot regardless.', '2004-06-30 19:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(788072, 86683, 22922, '<td valign="top">Pretty, but not extraordinary.</td>', 'Pretty, but not extraordinary.', '2004-06-30 19:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(788073, 85569, 22922, '<td valign="top">um, ok, are we going for extraordinarily smelly? wierd photo, doesn''t make sense without a title, doesn''t evoke "decaying tuna"</td>', 'um, ok, are we going for extraordinarily smelly? wierd photo, doesn''t make sense without a title, doesn''t evoke "decaying tuna"', '2004-06-30 19:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(788074, 86722, 22922, '<td valign="top">OK, wierd image, but I''ll go with it.  Nice thought.</td>', 'OK, wierd image, but I''ll go with it.  Nice thought.', '2004-06-30 19:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(788078, 86629, 22922, '<td valign="top">What is this supposed to be?  The light is too bright and the dark too dark, regardless, and M/W means nothing in this context.</td>', 'What is this supposed to be?  The light is too bright and the dark too dark, regardless, and M/W means nothing in this context.', '2004-06-30 19:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
