(788426, 86665, 23412, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot.  That bird really has personal qualities and you captured them perfectly.  I''ve watched these birds some and this is an extraordinary pose.  Great focus on the bird and the depth of field washes out the distractions nicely.  Looking hard for something to change, the only thing I can think of would be to keep the feet, but even then I don''t know that it could be any better.  I love it!</td>', 'Excellent shot.  That bird really has personal qualities and you captured them perfectly.  I''ve watched these birds some and this is an extraordinary pose.  Great focus on the bird and the depth of field washes out the distractions nicely.  Looking hard for something to change, the only thing I can think of would be to keep the feet, but even then I don''t know that it could be any better.  I love it!', '2004-06-30 23:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
