(788443, 86621, 9747, '<td valign="top">Wowers! Took me a few seconds to realize that those are cars on the wheel! (What exactly is this, anyway? A ferris wheel for cars - seriously?) Anyway, I wish the smokestack wasn''t there but I know it can''t be helped. Sky is great, but overall I think the picture needs some contrast to bring the wheel out. Truly an extraordinary picture. Well done!</td>', 'Wowers! Took me a few seconds to realize that those are cars on the wheel! (What exactly is this, anyway? A ferris wheel for cars - seriously?) Anyway, I wish the smokestack wasn''t there but I know it can''t be helped. Sky is great, but overall I think the picture needs some contrast to bring the wheel out. Truly an extraordinary picture. Well done!', '2004-06-30 23:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
