(788663, 86657, 8054, '<td valign="top">Composition is 98% perfect. The top of the tower is chopped off and there is no cushion space above it. Color balance is off or might be white balance. Also your photo has a considerable amount of noise. Mostly as a result of too high of an ISO setting or the exposure is too long or even both.</td>', 'Composition is 98% perfect. The top of the tower is chopped off and there is no cushion space above it. Color balance is off or might be white balance. Also your photo has a considerable amount of noise. Mostly as a result of too high of an ISO setting or the exposure is too long or even both.', '2004-07-01 01:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(788666, 86529, 8054, '<td valign="top">Nice motion shot but for some reason the angle of the blur in proportion to the direction of the bike is weird.</td>', 'Nice motion shot but for some reason the angle of the blur in proportion to the direction of the bike is weird.', '2004-07-01 01:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(788671, 86721, 8054, '<td valign="top">Now this is a great action shot. The bike is going in the correct direction and the blurred background (and foreground) are what I''d expect with the direction the bike is travelling. Great colors and details of the bike and rider. Well cropped, too. 10</td>', 'Now this is a great action shot. The bike is going in the correct direction and the blurred background (and foreground) are what I''d expect with the direction the bike is travelling. Great colors and details of the bike and rider. Well cropped, too. 10', '2004-07-01 01:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(788680, 86393, 8054, '<td valign="top">With this angle and crop, it almost feels abstract and I like that. It''s a fresh approach. However, the head of the cow is a bit bright and seems overexposed. Curves adjustment might have helped in addition to levels.</td>', 'With this angle and crop, it almost feels abstract and I like that. It''s a fresh approach. However, the head of the cow is a bit bright and seems overexposed. Curves adjustment might have helped in addition to levels.', '2004-07-01 01:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
