(788700, 86575, 8054, '<td valign="top">Details seem to be lost in the wings, body and any point of the dragonfly that should be in sharp focus. It''s almost as if there is a haze between the body of the dragonfly and the camera preventing sharp focus possibly due to compression. Color balance seems to be in favor of green and it feels different but not bad. Cropping could use some work as there feels like too much space at the top. Lop off about 1/4 to 1/2 inch.</td>', 'Details seem to be lost in the wings, body and any point of the dragonfly that should be in sharp focus. It''s almost as if there is a haze between the body of the dragonfly and the camera preventing sharp focus possibly due to compression. Color balance seems to be in favor of green and it feels different but not bad. Cropping could use some work as there feels like too much space at the top. Lop off about 1/4 to 1/2 inch.', '2004-07-01 01:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
