(789461, 86616, 14603, '<td valign="top">An extraordinary image rather than an image of something extraordinary.<br/>You have certainly managed to make this very interesting by excellent use of light and zoom? and shallow DOF.<br/>I really like the sharpness of the foreground receding into a soft blur in the darker background and the reflection in the glass is the icing on the cake.<br/>Top shot.</td>', 'An extraordinary image rather than an image of something extraordinary.You have certainly managed to make this very interesting by excellent use of light and zoom? and shallow DOF.I really like the sharpness of the foreground receding into a soft blur in the darker background and the reflection in the glass is the icing on the cake.Top shot.', '2004-07-01 08:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
