(789921, 86497, 8054, '<td valign="top">If I were to be REALLY picky about the title I would. I read the title, if it has multiple items, to see if they are in some sort of order that matches the title like direction from top down. In this case it does not match. The main point of focus appears to be the cup of beer and it is lit rather harshly by a flash. I don''t see any obvious vegetables in the lower right so I must trust you that they are there. I do, however, see two horses.</td>', 'If I were to be REALLY picky about the title I would. I read the title, if it has multiple items, to see if they are in some sort of order that matches the title like direction from top down. In this case it does not match. The main point of focus appears to be the cup of beer and it is lit rather harshly by a flash. I don''t see any obvious vegetables in the lower right so I must trust you that they are there. I do, however, see two horses.', '2004-07-01 12:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(789926, 86150, 13136, '<td valign="top">Cute girls. A bit overexposed, but good focus.</td>', 'Cute girls. A bit overexposed, but good focus.', '2004-07-01 12:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(789935, 86129, 8054, '<td valign="top">Excellent night shot but I think you could have framed/cropped it better. Use the water for the bottom of the photo vs the railing and ground and add more sky.</td>', 'Excellent night shot but I think you could have framed/cropped it better. Use the water for the bottom of the photo vs the railing and ground and add more sky.', '2004-07-01 12:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(789939, 86692, 8054, '<td valign="top">Good hand placement as it leads our eyes straight up to the infant''s face. Sepia/duotone was also a good choice. Focus seems to be a bit soft on the hands however. And it''s confusing because above the infant''s fingers I see a sharpening halo so I''m not sure what you did here. Maybe it''s just my eyes.</td>', 'Good hand placement as it leads our eyes straight up to the infant''s face. Sepia/duotone was also a good choice. Focus seems to be a bit soft on the hands however. And it''s confusing because above the infant''s fingers I see a sharpening halo so I''m not sure what you did here. Maybe it''s just my eyes.', '2004-07-01 12:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(789947, 85756, 8054, '<td valign="top">I see a nice and balanced b/w picture but nothing too extraordinary. Maybe the fact that the insides of the swimshorts are on the outside but that''s about it.</td>', 'I see a nice and balanced b/w picture but nothing too extraordinary. Maybe the fact that the insides of the swimshorts are on the outside but that''s about it.', '2004-07-01 12:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
