(790258, 86432, 12827, '<td valign="top">too funny!! LOL</td>', 'too funny!! LOL', '2004-07-01 14:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(790260, 85558, 19322, '<td valign="top">I like repetitive patterns, too, but find them challenging.  The shallow depth of field here leaves me looking for a focus.</td>', 'I like repetitive patterns, too, but find them challenging.  The shallow depth of field here leaves me looking for a focus.', '2004-07-01 14:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(790264, 85389, 19322, '<td valign="top">you conveyed it nicely.</td>', 'you conveyed it nicely.', '2004-07-01 14:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(790271, 86591, 19322, '<td valign="top">Some nice convergences in this shot.</td>', 'Some nice convergences in this shot.', '2004-07-01 15:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(790273, 86614, 15891, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy looking at this shot. The lines and curves are very elegant. The lighting is perfect. This is the kind of photograph that I like to see when voting on a challenge - alot of thought and work went into it obviously. I am looking forward to the end of the challenge so that I can find out how you made this amaizing image.</td>', 'I really enjoy looking at this shot. The lines and curves are very elegant. The lighting is perfect. This is the kind of photograph that I like to see when voting on a challenge - alot of thought and work went into it obviously. I am looking forward to the end of the challenge so that I can find out how you made this amaizing image.', '2004-07-01 15:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(790281, 86750, 19322, '<td valign="top">It''s disconcerting to have your eye pulled to the left for a focus, leaving most of the picture fuzzy both in focus and meaning.</td>', 'It''s disconcerting to have your eye pulled to the left for a focus, leaving most of the picture fuzzy both in focus and meaning.', '2004-07-01 15:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(790289, 86587, 19322, '<td valign="top">I can''t decide where to look in this picture.</td>', 'I can''t decide where to look in this picture.', '2004-07-01 15:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(790301, 85946, 9668, '<td valign="top">The architecture is pretty interesting, but i think the quality of this shot could be a bit better. Good perspective. I like the contrast of the colors on the chairs/ floor to the blue of the pattern.</td>', 'The architecture is pretty interesting, but i think the quality of this shot could be a bit better. Good perspective. I like the contrast of the colors on the chairs/ floor to the blue of the pattern.', '2004-07-01 15:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(790304, 86614, 18485, '<td valign="top">this is a lovely portrait of an interesting veggie.  well done, good luck!</td>', 'this is a lovely portrait of an interesting veggie.  well done, good luck!', '2004-07-01 15:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(790305, 86339, 13136, '<td valign="top">Too strange.<br/>If the shot was pulled back a little bit more I could get a better idea of what was going on. The motion blur on the arms does not work much for me. Actually, the very first thng to catch the eye is the shadow on his chest and the bulging pecs making the first impression of a woman''s breast almost exposed. The title works well.</td>', 'Too strange.If the shot was pulled back a little bit more I could get a better idea of what was going on. The motion blur on the arms does not work much for me. Actually, the very first thng to catch the eye is the shadow on his chest and the bulging pecs making the first impression of a woman''s breast almost exposed. The title works well.', '2004-07-01 15:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(790306, 85916, 18485, '<td valign="top">hilarious subject, well captured...had to do a double take to realize what is extraordinary here.  nice work.</td>', 'hilarious subject, well captured...had to do a double take to realize what is extraordinary here.  nice work.', '2004-07-01 15:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(790308, 86432, 3102, '<td valign="top">Heh heh... heh.  I''m sure plenty of other people are going to say the same juvenile thoughts that I''m thinking, so I''ll just leave it at that :)</td>', 'Heh heh... heh.  I''m sure plenty of other people are going to say the same juvenile thoughts that I''m thinking, so I''ll just leave it at that :)', '2004-07-01 15:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(790312, 86211, 18485, '<td valign="top">this is great...the smile on your flag/model''s face is priceless.  would love it if the treetops did not distract...minor complaint.  good luck with this fun shot.</td>', 'this is great...the smile on your flag/model''s face is priceless.  would love it if the treetops did not distract...minor complaint.  good luck with this fun shot.', '2004-07-01 15:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(790316, 86389, 19322, '<td valign="top">I hope you''re not a true believer!</td>', 'I hope you''re not a true believer!', '2004-07-01 15:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(790317, 86623, 3102, '<td valign="top">It was just on the news this afternoon that researchers have just created the first ever natural blue rose.  The project took 14 years of study, making me wonder if these guys really have a little too much time on their hands, or what!?</td>', 'It was just on the news this afternoon that researchers have just created the first ever natural blue rose.  The project took 14 years of study, making me wonder if these guys really have a little too much time on their hands, or what!?', '2004-07-01 15:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
