(791686, 86706, 19608, '<td valign="top">Oh my.  This image shows vision, talent and incredible emotion. The hint of green in the rolled bale adds tremendous credibility. I would normally say the white shirt doesn''t work - but with the brighter background..it does.<br/> <br/>There''s a train to "Ribbonsville" - your destination.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Oh my.  This image shows vision, talent and incredible emotion. The hint of green in the rolled bale adds tremendous credibility. I would normally say the white shirt doesn''t work - but with the brighter background..it does. There''s a train to "Ribbonsville" - your destination. ', '2004-07-02 01:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(791687, 85797, 19608, '<td valign="top">Incredibly simply yet very artistic and graphic.  You could say "extraordinary" even.  The clear crisp blue sky is great as is the unusual perespective here.  The only problem I have is very easily fixed.  Your file size is only 15 KB - so there is some banding in the white in the bottom half.  The fix is not compressing the image so much - use as much of your 150 KB limit as you  need.<br/> <br/>Overall - it''s still a stunning and creative work of art.</td>', 'Incredibly simply yet very artistic and graphic.  You could say "extraordinary" even.  The clear crisp blue sky is great as is the unusual perespective here.  The only problem I have is very easily fixed.  Your file size is only 15 KB - so there is some banding in the white in the bottom half.  The fix is not compressing the image so much - use as much of your 150 KB limit as you  need. Overall - it''s still a stunning and creative work of art.', '2004-07-02 01:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(791689, 86527, 19608, '<td valign="top">You have a nice, pleasant green and hazy area - but I''m not sure what else you are telling me.</td>', 'You have a nice, pleasant green and hazy area - but I''m not sure what else you are telling me.', '2004-07-02 01:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(791690, 86567, 8054, '<td valign="top">Mr. Zanardi himself is extraordinary but I do not find this photograph, on its own merits, to be extraordinary. I feel there is a fine line between the subject itself carrying the weight of the challenge requirements vs the photo as a whole meaning both the subject itself and the way it was photographed. You did, however, do an excellent job of capturing Mr. Zanardi with attention to details such as focus and composition.</td>', 'Mr. Zanardi himself is extraordinary but I do not find this photograph, on its own merits, to be extraordinary. I feel there is a fine line between the subject itself carrying the weight of the challenge requirements vs the photo as a whole meaning both the subject itself and the way it was photographed. You did, however, do an excellent job of capturing Mr. Zanardi with attention to details such as focus and composition.', '2004-07-02 02:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(791691, 86612, 20214, '<td valign="top">I''m speechless. There are better things in life to photograph than this. I''m sorry if I have offended you in any way but this photo is not a very good representation of Extraordinary.</td>', 'I''m speechless. There are better things in life to photograph than this. I''m sorry if I have offended you in any way but this photo is not a very good representation of Extraordinary.', '2004-07-02 02:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
