(791712, 86527, 9668, '<td valign="top">Interesting DOF, makes the liquid/reflection stand out. Seems a bit abstract. I''m not quite sure what would be extraordinary about it, besides that it is black and has an image reflecting off it. The contrast of green and black works well. The image by itself doesn''t say much too me.</td>', 'Interesting DOF, makes the liquid/reflection stand out. Seems a bit abstract. I''m not quite sure what would be extraordinary about it, besides that it is black and has an image reflecting off it. The contrast of green and black works well. The image by itself doesn''t say much too me.', '2004-07-02 02:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(791714, 86751, 23251, '<td valign="top">Great photo! Love the shift of focus effect and the change of light ! Congrats.</td>', 'Great photo! Love the shift of focus effect and the change of light ! Congrats.', '2004-07-02 02:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
