(791729, 85448, 9668, '<td valign="top">I like the shot, but I don''t like the title. I don''t need to be told if it is extraordinary or not, that''s the decision the voters make, I feel like I''m being solicited by that statement, as well as the one at the beggining. If I never see it, why am I seeing a picture of it. Yes, I never see it in real life, but I''ve never seen giraffe in real life either (haven''t visited Africa, or a zoo with them in it yet). <br/> <br/>The shot itself is a bit extraordinary, kindof cute, kind of humorous. Too bad about clipping the ear.<br/></td>', 'I like the shot, but I don''t like the title. I don''t need to be told if it is extraordinary or not, that''s the decision the voters make, I feel like I''m being solicited by that statement, as well as the one at the beggining. If I never see it, why am I seeing a picture of it. Yes, I never see it in real life, but I''ve never seen giraffe in real life either (haven''t visited Africa, or a zoo with them in it yet).  The shot itself is a bit extraordinary, kindof cute, kind of humorous. Too bad about clipping the ear.', '2004-07-02 02:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
