(791753, 86557, 17279, '<td valign="top">Nice color on the ship.  I have a hard time judging the scale on this, but I am assuming its huge.  Some sort of reference to relative size could be helpful.  Also the sky is blown out (not sure you can do anything about that without losing detail on the ship though).</td>', 'Nice color on the ship.  I have a hard time judging the scale on this, but I am assuming its huge.  Some sort of reference to relative size could be helpful.  Also the sky is blown out (not sure you can do anything about that without losing detail on the ship though).', '2004-07-02 03:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
