(791790, 86417, 17279, '<td valign="top">Is the firecracker supposed to be going off here?  Hard to tell.  If it is, there are no sparks, which makes it just look like a broken firecracker.</td>', 'Is the firecracker supposed to be going off here?  Hard to tell.  If it is, there are no sparks, which makes it just look like a broken firecracker.', '2004-07-02 03:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
