(791888, 86692, 15920, '<td valign="top">This is great compositionally.  I''m just not sure that you wouldn''t have had more impact if the DOF was enlarged enough to keep both generations in focus.  Either way, nice shot.</td>', 'This is great compositionally.  I''m just not sure that you wouldn''t have had more impact if the DOF was enlarged enough to keep both generations in focus.  Either way, nice shot.', '2004-07-02 07:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(791889, 86129, 15920, '<td valign="top">Love the effect on the smoke.  Only time I have seen someone manage to make pollution look good.</td>', 'Love the effect on the smoke.  Only time I have seen someone manage to make pollution look good.', '2004-07-02 07:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(791890, 86444, 17811, '<td valign="top">salinely detailed.</td>', 'salinely detailed.', '2004-07-02 07:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(791891, 85389, 15920, '<td valign="top">If you didn''t have fun taking this picture, you need a new hobby.  Nice job on catching four happy expressions at once.  B&amp;W would not have been my choice for this shot but you made it work.  A little sharper focus on the top kid would have gotten an extra point. -8</td>', 'If you didn''t have fun taking this picture, you need a new hobby.  Nice job on catching four happy expressions at once.  B&W would not have been my choice for this shot but you made it work.  A little sharper focus on the top kid would have gotten an extra point. -8', '2004-07-02 07:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
