(791897, 85789, 15920, '<td valign="top">I think people will have a hard time understanding the story behind the dog from the Victor comapny without some context, but good luck.</td>', 'I think people will have a hard time understanding the story behind the dog from the Victor comapny without some context, but good luck.', '2004-07-02 07:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
