(791933, 86340, 17811, '<td valign="top">dejavu.</td>', 'dejavu.', '2004-07-02 08:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(791994, 85621, 19841, '<td valign="top">Ok, this is one case where turning the picture sideways doesn''t annoy me.  It really adds to the humor of the shot.   The image seems a little contrasty, though, whites blown out and darks lumpy.  5</td>', 'Ok, this is one case where turning the picture sideways doesn''t annoy me.  It really adds to the humor of the shot.   The image seems a little contrasty, though, whites blown out and darks lumpy.  5', '2004-07-02 10:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(792006, 86451, 23747, '<td valign="top">those are magic mushrooms...</td>', 'those are magic mushrooms...', '2004-07-02 10:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(792018, 86598, 21312, '<td valign="top">I like this. Great idea, great execution.</td>', 'I like this. Great idea, great execution.', '2004-07-02 10:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(792031, 85828, 20981, '<td valign="top">Captures the moment</td>', 'Captures the moment', '2004-07-02 10:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(792047, 86285, 19841, '<td valign="top">Now, of only you had more detail on those craters...</td>', 'Now, of only you had more detail on those craters...', '2004-07-02 11:06:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(792049, 86527, 19841, '<td valign="top">It''s a nifty shot, but the cup is too much out of focus for it to work.</td>', 'It''s a nifty shot, but the cup is too much out of focus for it to work.', '2004-07-02 11:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(792054, 86550, 19841, '<td valign="top">While this is a nice picture, neither the flower or the photo are extraordinary in any way.</td>', 'While this is a nice picture, neither the flower or the photo are extraordinary in any way.', '2004-07-02 11:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(792060, 86211, 1570, '<td valign="top">really fun picture! would be even better if you croped off the tops of the trees, but you probably heard that a few times by now... 8.</td>', 'really fun picture! would be even better if you croped off the tops of the trees, but you probably heard that a few times by now... 8.', '2004-07-02 11:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(792062, 86587, 19841, '<td valign="top">Sunsets happen every day.  If this was an unusually spectacular sunset, I might go for it, but it is rather ordinary.</td>', 'Sunsets happen every day.  If this was an unusually spectacular sunset, I might go for it, but it is rather ordinary.', '2004-07-02 11:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(792066, 86405, 21611, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, I think everybody is striving to define "extraordinary" I think that the silhouette gets lost in the background.  Very creative.</td>', 'Nice colors, I think everybody is striving to define "extraordinary" I think that the silhouette gets lost in the background.  Very creative.', '2004-07-02 11:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(792069, 85569, 1570, '<td valign="top">it''s hard finding something that isn''t extraordinary...  most things are pretty impressive when you take a good look... but this isn''t! not by itself nor as a photograph... 1.</td>', 'it''s hard finding something that isn''t extraordinary...  most things are pretty impressive when you take a good look... but this isn''t! not by itself nor as a photograph... 1.', '2004-07-02 11:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(792073, 86467, 21611, '<td valign="top">A rainbow is by definition extraordinary, You have some tough competition from some of the other rainbow shots in this comp. The scenery is nice and I would have liked to see more zoom. I am not sure if the second rainbow is intended. Overall nice work.</td>', 'A rainbow is by definition extraordinary, You have some tough competition from some of the other rainbow shots in this comp. The scenery is nice and I would have liked to see more zoom. I am not sure if the second rainbow is intended. Overall nice work.', '2004-07-02 11:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(792075, 86029, 19841, '<td valign="top">I can see what you were going for, but the overexposure takes all the zing out of the image.</td>', 'I can see what you were going for, but the overexposure takes all the zing out of the image.', '2004-07-02 11:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(792076, 86032, 18349, '<td valign="top">You''ll have to hook me up with that one... LOL  ;o)<br/>Excellent take on the challenge.  One of my favorites.  :o)</td>', 'You''ll have to hook me up with that one... LOL  ;o)Excellent take on the challenge.  One of my favorites.  :o)', '2004-07-02 11:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(792078, 85558, 21611, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective. I guess extraordinary means diffrent things to diffrent people. ( I am not too sure my own shot is all that extraordinary to others) I would like to know what the shot is! I also think the focus should have been better. Either the foreground or background. But all in all very creative.</td>', 'Interesting perspective. I guess extraordinary means diffrent things to diffrent people. ( I am not too sure my own shot is all that extraordinary to others) I would like to know what the shot is! I also think the focus should have been better. Either the foreground or background. But all in all very creative.', '2004-07-02 11:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(792083, 86444, 21611, '<td valign="top">Came back to your shot and bumped up my original score. Nice macro shot showing detail and color. I think all scores suffered in this comp because of many pics just not being "extraordinary" to many viewers. . Why such a tight crop on the upper antenna.(Is that what its called?)Very nice shot overall.</td>', 'Came back to your shot and bumped up my original score. Nice macro shot showing detail and color. I think all scores suffered in this comp because of many pics just not being "extraordinary" to many viewers. . Why such a tight crop on the upper antenna.(Is that what its called?)Very nice shot overall.', '2004-07-02 11:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(792088, 86044, 21430, '<td valign="top">Wow, I find it extraordinary that anyone would still have a large and relatively clean collection of these little blue guys... <br/> <br/>I remember collecting these when I was a kid... They were a serious fad back then.</td>', 'Wow, I find it extraordinary that anyone would still have a large and relatively clean collection of these little blue guys...  I remember collecting these when I was a kid... They were a serious fad back then.', '2004-07-02 11:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(792091, 86432, 21430, '<td valign="top">Ehehe... Is it just me, or does this rock look sort of you know...<br/> <br/>Nice shot, although I think it would look much nicer if was possible to get the shot wtih more of a blue sky...</td>', 'Ehehe... Is it just me, or does this rock look sort of you know... Nice shot, although I think it would look much nicer if was possible to get the shot wtih more of a blue sky...', '2004-07-02 11:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(792095, 86317, 21430, '<td valign="top">I would like to see how this was/is done. <br/> <br/>Is this a permanent sculpture or something you whipped up temporarily?</td>', 'I would like to see how this was/is done.  Is this a permanent sculpture or something you whipped up temporarily?', '2004-07-02 11:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(792102, 86714, 21430, '<td valign="top">To me, I would like this shot better without the person looking up at the structure...<br/> <br/>Beyond that, I really like the way you were able to capture the collor of the sky and the clarity of your primary subject.</td>', 'To me, I would like this shot better without the person looking up at the structure... Beyond that, I really like the way you were able to capture the collor of the sky and the clarity of your primary subject.', '2004-07-02 11:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(792105, 86751, 21430, '<td valign="top">Very cool concept. I take it that you took a picture of your model in a brighter setting, printed out a large image of that, cut out the face, pasted it to a hand-mirror and snapped this one?<br/> <br/>Very cool.<br/> <br/>I really like the coloration in this, especially the contrast of skin tone from the face "behind'' the mirror...</td>', 'Very cool concept. I take it that you took a picture of your model in a brighter setting, printed out a large image of that, cut out the face, pasted it to a hand-mirror and snapped this one? Very cool. I really like the coloration in this, especially the contrast of skin tone from the face "behind'' the mirror...', '2004-07-02 11:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(792108, 86234, 21430, '<td valign="top">Dang golf cart. Without that in the image, I would rate this one higher.</td>', 'Dang golf cart. Without that in the image, I would rate this one higher.', '2004-07-02 11:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(792158, 86389, 22922, '<td valign="top">If I didn''t know it was fake, I guess it would be pretty extraordinary.  Interesting idea, nice choice of focus.</td>', 'If I didn''t know it was fake, I guess it would be pretty extraordinary.  Interesting idea, nice choice of focus.', '2004-07-02 12:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(792164, 86490, 21058, '<td valign="top">fantastic shot - it looks so high!</td>', 'fantastic shot - it looks so high!', '2004-07-02 12:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
