(792171, 86534, 8624, '<td valign="top">nice rose image. I think a tighter crop would have resulted in a much sronger image. The foliage competes with the bloom and you have these great water drops that merit more detail.</td>', 'nice rose image. I think a tighter crop would have resulted in a much sronger image. The foliage competes with the bloom and you have these great water drops that merit more detail.', '2004-07-02 12:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(792175, 86497, 8624, '<td valign="top">I give you credit for trying to juxtapose interesting contrasting subjects, but the technical details on this shot need a lot of work. The plastic cup isn''t that interesting as a foreground subject and it is made less so by the hotspots from the flash and the foam sticking to the top of the cup. There is nothing that jumps out at my from the vegetables in the garden area. Perhaps a lower viewing angle might have produced a more interesting composition.</td>', 'I give you credit for trying to juxtapose interesting contrasting subjects, but the technical details on this shot need a lot of work. The plastic cup isn''t that interesting as a foreground subject and it is made less so by the hotspots from the flash and the foam sticking to the top of the cup. There is nothing that jumps out at my from the vegetables in the garden area. Perhaps a lower viewing angle might have produced a more interesting composition.', '2004-07-02 12:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
