(792184, 86458, 8624, '<td valign="top">This is a really interesting shot. Water reflections like this have been done before, but what catches my eye is the "unnatural" traingualr and diamond shapes created in the center of the swooping curves of the water plants. This combination of organic forms and rigid geometry works great. nicely seen and captured!</td>', 'This is a really interesting shot. Water reflections like this have been done before, but what catches my eye is the "unnatural" traingualr and diamond shapes created in the center of the swooping curves of the water plants. This combination of organic forms and rigid geometry works great. nicely seen and captured!', '2004-07-02 12:20:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(792185, 85598, 8624, '<td valign="top">beautiful colors</td>', 'beautiful colors', '2004-07-02 12:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(792188, 86594, 8624, '<td valign="top">excellent flame shapes captured. fire is hard to do because you can''t really predict how the flames will be formed at any given point in time. this shot has nice balance and good use of negative space.</td>', 'excellent flame shapes captured. fire is hard to do because you can''t really predict how the flames will be formed at any given point in time. this shot has nice balance and good use of negative space.', '2004-07-02 12:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
