(793662, 86083, 2764, '<td valign="top">This is a plant, right?  It would make a great character in a horror movie.  The crop is a little too tight.  Just like not cutting off peoples hands and feet, I think you shouldn''t have cropped the wacko staemns.  This is over exposed, I wonder how the purple would have looked under exposed.  Or if the baclground had been white, the overexposed look might have made a nice high key image.  The backgound is dtstracting,</td>', 'This is a plant, right?  It would make a great character in a horror movie.  The crop is a little too tight.  Just like not cutting off peoples hands and feet, I think you shouldn''t have cropped the wacko staemns.  This is over exposed, I wonder how the purple would have looked under exposed.  Or if the baclground had been white, the overexposed look might have made a nice high key image.  The backgound is dtstracting,', '2004-07-03 08:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(793677, 85654, 15920, '<td valign="top">Didn''t your mother ever tell you you could go blind looking at things like that? <br/> <br/>This is an exceptionally clever shot with a perfect expression from the model.  I do think the lighting could have been just a little brighter.</td>', 'Didn''t your mother ever tell you you could go blind looking at things like that?  This is an exceptionally clever shot with a perfect expression from the model.  I do think the lighting could have been just a little brighter.', '2004-07-03 09:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(793679, 85906, 2764, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo,  The angle emphasizes the creepyness of the double jointed fingers.  The lighting is oerfect, makes it look like the kitchen table or even a school cafeteria table, combining the mundane with the bizarre.  The chewed down fingernails add to the impression that it is a teen hand.  A metaphor for those awkward years?</td>', 'This is a great photo,  The angle emphasizes the creepyness of the double jointed fingers.  The lighting is oerfect, makes it look like the kitchen table or even a school cafeteria table, combining the mundane with the bizarre.  The chewed down fingernails add to the impression that it is a teen hand.  A metaphor for those awkward years?', '2004-07-03 09:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(793684, 86700, 2764, '<td valign="top">This is going to get knocked down in the scoring.  It looks too much like a "snap shot".  It is a picture with appeal to the family but not to the general public.  The angle is odd, Is he sleeping upright?  If you look at the whole image, most of it is taken up by "products"  Pooh sleeper, baby blanket, pacifier.  Not much baby there.  And what of the baby - we don''t see much of the misracle of him either.  His cheek and forehead?  Where are his eyes?, his smile? his characater?  The Pooh gets mor attenetion than he does.</td>', 'This is going to get knocked down in the scoring.  It looks too much like a "snap shot".  It is a picture with appeal to the family but not to the general public.  The angle is odd, Is he sleeping upright?  If you look at the whole image, most of it is taken up by "products"  Pooh sleeper, baby blanket, pacifier.  Not much baby there.  And what of the baby - we don''t see much of the misracle of him either.  His cheek and forehead?  Where are his eyes?, his smile? his characater?  The Pooh gets mor attenetion than he does.', '2004-07-03 09:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
