(794185, 85802, 21478, '<td valign="top">Great shot of a rare event - wonderful depth of field, and good lighting. Glad you kept it in color, b&amp;W (as some do) would have obscured much of this. Nice shot!</td>', 'Great shot of a rare event - wonderful depth of field, and good lighting. Glad you kept it in color, b&W (as some do) would have obscured much of this. Nice shot!', '2004-07-03 18:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(794186, 86558, 21478, '<td valign="top">Great work - I''m hoping you concocted this with two eggs and simply removed a shell. Cracking eggs until you found a double would have been pretty impressive though. Nice color - I think a little more light would have added to the image though. Great idea!</td>', 'Great work - I''m hoping you concocted this with two eggs and simply removed a shell. Cracking eggs until you found a double would have been pretty impressive though. Nice color - I think a little more light would have added to the image though. Great idea!', '2004-07-03 18:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(794187, 86456, 21478, '<td valign="top">This mountain may have looked beautiful when you shot the image, but the image doesn''t show it. In my humble opinion, I would have used a polarizer to get a better defined sky, and also upped the saturation on the mountains - they are dull and grey. Also, (and I don''t know if you could or couldn''t) but waiting for more sidelighting to bring out the texture in the mountains more would have been nice.</td>', 'This mountain may have looked beautiful when you shot the image, but the image doesn''t show it. In my humble opinion, I would have used a polarizer to get a better defined sky, and also upped the saturation on the mountains - they are dull and grey. Also, (and I don''t know if you could or couldn''t) but waiting for more sidelighting to bring out the texture in the mountains more would have been nice.', '2004-07-03 19:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(794188, 86340, 18757, '<td valign="top">Its wonderful.. I would like to learn your camera setting when you shot this photo...</td>', 'Its wonderful.. I would like to learn your camera setting when you shot this photo...', '2004-07-03 19:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(794190, 86752, 8054, '<td valign="top">A very different flower no doubt about that. The way it was cropped is the first thing that I see. The bottom looks as if it could have used more space and the top looks like it has too much. But focus is sharp and colors are nice and appear muted but it looks good.</td>', 'A very different flower no doubt about that. The way it was cropped is the first thing that I see. The bottom looks as if it could have used more space and the top looks like it has too much. But focus is sharp and colors are nice and appear muted but it looks good.', '2004-07-03 19:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(794191, 86608, 8054, '<td valign="top">A bit bright and the clouds seem overexposed. A very nice landscape photo!</td>', 'A bit bright and the clouds seem overexposed. A very nice landscape photo!', '2004-07-03 19:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
