(794669, 86492, 9668, '<td valign="top">Did you know that the inside of these muscles are bright orange? And they are edible, but I don''t like them. When alive they reach out with thier tentacles and feed on whatever comes to them. This guy either died of old age or more likely another predator (oyster catcher, human, seastar/starfish) got to em. Ok, lecture over. <br/>Nice shot. I like that it is overexposed, I also like the debris of the left, makes it seem more natural. Good coloration I would like the entire image to shift to the right a bit though. <br/></td>', 'Did you know that the inside of these muscles are bright orange? And they are edible, but I don''t like them. When alive they reach out with thier tentacles and feed on whatever comes to them. This guy either died of old age or more likely another predator (oyster catcher, human, seastar/starfish) got to em. Ok, lecture over. Nice shot. I like that it is overexposed, I also like the debris of the left, makes it seem more natural. Good coloration I would like the entire image to shift to the right a bit though. ', '2004-07-04 03:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(794670, 86615, 8054, '<td valign="top">Great focus and details of everything from the banner behind him to the textiles on the ground. Perspective is very good but maybe if it were taken a bit lower and maybe closer to eye level of the subject. Background is a bit bright but details are still present in the banner as I can see the fine wrinkles. Excellent shot overall!</td>', 'Great focus and details of everything from the banner behind him to the textiles on the ground. Perspective is very good but maybe if it were taken a bit lower and maybe closer to eye level of the subject. Background is a bit bright but details are still present in the banner as I can see the fine wrinkles. Excellent shot overall!', '2004-07-04 03:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(794673, 86700, 8054, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t show the actual birth of the baby which is what I expect to see with this title. I see a newborn that is sleeping which is what they do very well. Focus seems to be sharper on the clothing and softer on the face. Maybe it''s the lighting that makes it appear that way.</td>', 'This doesn''t show the actual birth of the baby which is what I expect to see with this title. I see a newborn that is sleeping which is what they do very well. Focus seems to be sharper on the clothing and softer on the face. Maybe it''s the lighting that makes it appear that way.', '2004-07-04 03:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(794676, 86335, 8054, '<td valign="top">This pueblo looks like a very good subject for photos that play with textures and light. But in this photo, it makes the pueblo appear more like a snapshot-style of photo vs one that could be more creative. Maybe try to narrow in on one specific part of the building like a window and door and give it some negative space. Let the natural light work for you. This was a beautiful day and it presented many opportunities. The wooden structure in the foreground is also distracting and blocks part of the pueblo.</td>', 'This pueblo looks like a very good subject for photos that play with textures and light. But in this photo, it makes the pueblo appear more like a snapshot-style of photo vs one that could be more creative. Maybe try to narrow in on one specific part of the building like a window and door and give it some negative space. Let the natural light work for you. This was a beautiful day and it presented many opportunities. The wooden structure in the foreground is also distracting and blocks part of the pueblo.', '2004-07-04 03:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(794678, 85389, 14202, '<td valign="top">the foliage in the forefront really distracts from a great fun photo...</td>', 'the foliage in the forefront really distracts from a great fun photo...', '2004-07-04 04:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(794681, 86452, 8054, '<td valign="top">Very nice image and use of curves and abstract symmetry (I made that term up). Contrast could use a little help to define the textures a little more. The really distracting point is that box near the middle of the photo. Real shame that is there to ruin such a great photo. Border is also a bit distracting as I really wanted my eyes to flow all the way to the frame constraints to enjoy the infinite feel you gave this photo. 7</td>', 'Very nice image and use of curves and abstract symmetry (I made that term up). Contrast could use a little help to define the textures a little more. The really distracting point is that box near the middle of the photo. Real shame that is there to ruin such a great photo. Border is also a bit distracting as I really wanted my eyes to flow all the way to the frame constraints to enjoy the infinite feel you gave this photo. 7', '2004-07-04 04:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(794685, 85500, 14202, '<td valign="top">Very iunteresting but I don''t seem to be able to find a focal point of this shot and the relationship to the title....hmmmm.</td>', 'Very iunteresting but I don''t seem to be able to find a focal point of this shot and the relationship to the title....hmmmm.', '2004-07-04 04:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(794686, 86482, 14202, '<td valign="top">great shot...</td>', 'great shot...', '2004-07-04 04:10:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(794687, 86553, 14202, '<td valign="top">maybe less crop on the right...to show the extent of the flame...</td>', 'maybe less crop on the right...to show the extent of the flame...', '2004-07-04 04:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
