(795947, 86591, 16046, '<td valign="top">I did that on the 30th in WA, I waited 10.5 hours and got to shake hands. Nice idea.</td>', 'I did that on the 30th in WA, I waited 10.5 hours and got to shake hands. Nice idea.', '2004-07-05 04:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(796025, 86403, 21652, '<td valign="top">An exceptionally strong and carefully crafted photograph. I guess it must have taken ages to capture. I wanted more reflections in the bubble. The scissors are great. Imaginative members will see the hungry, stainless steel alien about to devour the bubble. The impressive moment on camera here is is the dent on the surface tension of the bubble. Now what did my old Science teacher tell me about water boatmen? Enjoyed this one - thank you.</td>', 'An exceptionally strong and carefully crafted photograph. I guess it must have taken ages to capture. I wanted more reflections in the bubble. The scissors are great. Imaginative members will see the hungry, stainless steel alien about to devour the bubble. The impressive moment on camera here is is the dent on the surface tension of the bubble. Now what did my old Science teacher tell me about water boatmen? Enjoyed this one - thank you.', '2004-07-05 07:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
