(797088, 86011, 12268, '<td valign="top">this is my fave shot fo the bunch. technically there''s nothing to complain about here... this implicates a lot to me, what with the fleeting childhood many have these days. Where I work has a backyard filled with torn &amp; worn out stuff animals. It looks like a teddy bear war took place with the remnants left over. I always wanted to take a shot of it. never did. I hope this ribbons! Good luck, 10!</td>', 'this is my fave shot fo the bunch. technically there''s nothing to complain about here... this implicates a lot to me, what with the fleeting childhood many have these days. Where I work has a backyard filled with torn & worn out stuff animals. It looks like a teddy bear war took place with the remnants left over. I always wanted to take a shot of it. never did. I hope this ribbons! Good luck, 10!', '2004-07-05 22:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
