(797406, 86417, 19914, '<td valign="top">It seems to me like standing still... if I am correct, you have it all laying on a yelow surface, with sand spread like in a explosion. I mean this because no fire light is present, and I had made many experiments like this and always appears the "bloom" with moving particle lights.</td>', 'It seems to me like standing still... if I am correct, you have it all laying on a yelow surface, with sand spread like in a explosion. I mean this because no fire light is present, and I had made many experiments like this and always appears the "bloom" with moving particle lights.', '2004-07-06 05:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
