(797433, 85428, 19914, '<td valign="top">ISO 1600+? Looks like the shoot was way too dark, then you used levels to bring light from darkness, so noise is extreme, more than a correct exposure under ISO 6000! But the effect, even if it was not intended, is nice, like puntillism (the noise is of "good quality" if you understand me)</td>', 'ISO 1600+? Looks like the shoot was way too dark, then you used levels to bring light from darkness, so noise is extreme, more than a correct exposure under ISO 6000! But the effect, even if it was not intended, is nice, like puntillism (the noise is of "good quality" if you understand me)', '2004-07-06 06:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
