(797705, 86695, 21430, '<td valign="top">I like the effect in this shot. I need to say that I would rate it higher, if the odd shape to the left of th sparks off the top of the left elbow was ''wiped'' out of the image.<br/> <br/>I would really like to see how this shot was made as it appears that it could be a light sculpture behind the model or something similar...</td>', 'I like the effect in this shot. I need to say that I would rate it higher, if the odd shape to the left of th sparks off the top of the left elbow was ''wiped'' out of the image. I would really like to see how this shot was made as it appears that it could be a light sculpture behind the model or something similar...', '2004-07-06 12:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(797706, 86621, 21430, '<td valign="top">Now that''s something you don''t see everyday. Very nifty apparetus.<br/> <br/>The image itself isn''t that bad either, although it would be nicer if some of the color popped out of it more.</td>', 'Now that''s something you don''t see everyday. Very nifty apparetus. The image itself isn''t that bad either, although it would be nicer if some of the color popped out of it more.', '2004-07-06 12:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(797710, 86666, 21430, '<td valign="top">This seems a little washed out in the background.<br/> <br/>How did you shoot this?<br/> <br/>I was recently reading how to setup shots in this kind of lighting condition by using the built-in flash on my camera to fill-flash the subject while keeping a faster shutter speed to make the background more even with the lighting of the subject. <br/> <br/>I don''t have the article in front of me, so my summary isn''t the best.</td>', 'This seems a little washed out in the background. How did you shoot this? I was recently reading how to setup shots in this kind of lighting condition by using the built-in flash on my camera to fill-flash the subject while keeping a faster shutter speed to make the background more even with the lighting of the subject.  I don''t have the article in front of me, so my summary isn''t the best.', '2004-07-06 12:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
