(797751, 86340, 19608, '<td valign="top">This image has a whole lot going for it.  Perfect choice of shutter speed to get the  flowing water.  The overly saturated greens on the bank are a bit "unreal" but worth the price to get the green on the rock so vibrant.    The worst thing about the image is the title - but no point deductef for that.</td>', 'This image has a whole lot going for it.  Perfect choice of shutter speed to get the  flowing water.  The overly saturated greens on the bank are a bit "unreal" but worth the price to get the green on the rock so vibrant.    The worst thing about the image is the title - but no point deductef for that.', '2004-07-06 13:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
