(797815, 86497, 19608, '<td valign="top">Maybe this should be in "Advertising" instead of "Extraordinary."  It would probably score a lot higher there.  Nice use of DoF - placing the emphasis on the beer.<br/> <br/>Improve it by:  a) Waiting for a better sky - the top 1/4 of your image is a bald white sky.  If there is no better sky - crop it out.  b) Use a more photogenic beer glass.  c) More side light on the glass instead of the straight on lighting (flash?) that produced the hasrh glare.</td>', 'Maybe this should be in "Advertising" instead of "Extraordinary."  It would probably score a lot higher there.  Nice use of DoF - placing the emphasis on the beer. Improve it by:  a) Waiting for a better sky - the top 1/4 of your image is a bald white sky.  If there is no better sky - crop it out.  b) Use a more photogenic beer glass.  c) More side light on the glass instead of the straight on lighting (flash?) that produced the hasrh glare.', '2004-07-06 14:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(797816, 85508, 10145, '<td valign="top">This photo brings me back to an early morning in late summer.....looking over the pond past the trees into the fog..memories!  Great photo....</td>', 'This photo brings me back to an early morning in late summer.....looking over the pond past the trees into the fog..memories!  Great photo....', '2004-07-06 14:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(797817, 86553, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and exposure.  Slim Jim frame is very effective for this image.</td>', 'Nice lighting and exposure.  Slim Jim frame is very effective for this image.', '2004-07-06 14:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(797820, 86612, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and excellent model.  I sure don''t get what the title means.</td>', 'Great lighting and excellent model.  I sure don''t get what the title means.', '2004-07-06 14:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(797822, 85786, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and exposure.  The black background is great but the green/yellow splotches on the left edge do not help.</td>', 'Great lighting and exposure.  The black background is great but the green/yellow splotches on the left edge do not help.', '2004-07-06 14:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(797824, 86563, 19608, '<td valign="top">Colorful and playful.  Good placement - filling the frame with color yet keeping the main subject off centered.  You may want to clone/crop out the guy on the left edge.</td>', 'Colorful and playful.  Good placement - filling the frame with color yet keeping the main subject off centered.  You may want to clone/crop out the guy on the left edge.', '2004-07-06 14:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(797826, 86502, 19608, '<td valign="top">NIce lighting and great idea.  It''s a captivating image.</td>', 'NIce lighting and great idea.  It''s a captivating image.', '2004-07-06 14:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(797827, 85863, 19608, '<td valign="top">Perfect capture of the action.  Exposure spot on - in flat lighting.</td>', 'Perfect capture of the action.  Exposure spot on - in flat lighting.', '2004-07-06 14:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(797830, 86417, 22964, '<td valign="top">Of course you didnt captured this explosion since there is no smoke and, given the speed of burn of powders, you would need a high speed flash shot of about<br/>1/1.000.000 second to freeze this image. Anyway good inventive.<br/></td>', 'Of course you didnt captured this explosion since there is no smoke and, given the speed of burn of powders, you would need a high speed flash shot of about1/1.000.000 second to freeze this image. Anyway good inventive.', '2004-07-06 14:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(797832, 86402, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great capture!  Pose is perfect as  is his expresion.  Robe colors are very rich - adding to the impact.  The dark background is very nice but the bighter green area surrounding his head does not work well for me.  Border = not needed.</td>', 'Great capture!  Pose is perfect as  is his expresion.  Robe colors are very rich - adding to the impact.  The dark background is very nice but the bighter green area surrounding his head does not work well for me.  Border = not needed.', '2004-07-06 14:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(797833, 86601, 22964, '<td valign="top">Too noisy ,  saturated and not well focused. With more effort it could became a good photograph.</td>', 'Too noisy ,  saturated and not well focused. With more effort it could became a good photograph.', '2004-07-06 14:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(797839, 86036, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and rim lighting.</td>', 'Nice composition and rim lighting.', '2004-07-06 14:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(797842, 86332, 22964, '<td valign="top">Are you hanging on your left hand?</td>', 'Are you hanging on your left hand?', '2004-07-06 14:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(797854, 85389, 2764, '<td valign="top">Such nice spf skin tones.  great composition, esp the leading lines - top to bottom kid, then the weed draws the eye back upp and into the scene -9</td>', 'Such nice spf skin tones.  great composition, esp the leading lines - top to bottom kid, then the weed draws the eye back upp and into the scene -9', '2004-07-06 14:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(797861, 85657, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great lighting on a perfect specimic.  It would work much better if it were not dead centered.<br/></td>', 'Great lighting on a perfect specimic.  It would work much better if it were not dead centered.', '2004-07-06 14:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(797866, 86431, 19608, '<td valign="top">Beautiful mountain and indeed extraordinary.  The sky does not help your image.</td>', 'Beautiful mountain and indeed extraordinary.  The sky does not help your image.', '2004-07-06 14:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(797871, 85911, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very interesting composition.  Great color combinations.  It was probbaly not possible, but would be nice if the petal closest to the lens was in focus.</td>', 'Very interesting composition.  Great color combinations.  It was probbaly not possible, but would be nice if the petal closest to the lens was in focus.', '2004-07-06 14:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(797876, 86622, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great colors - the blue and green work very well together.  Water drops add a lot of impact.  The bright white areas in the tyop right detract.</td>', 'Great colors - the blue and green work very well together.  Water drops add a lot of impact.  The bright white areas in the tyop right detract.', '2004-07-06 14:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(797879, 86714, 19608, '<td valign="top">Indeed an extraordinary structure.  Nice exposure and composition.</td>', 'Indeed an extraordinary structure.  Nice exposure and composition.', '2004-07-06 14:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(797886, 86751, 19608, '<td valign="top">Clever!  Great lighting on a beautiful model. It could use more definition on the model''s dress.</td>', 'Clever!  Great lighting on a beautiful model. It could use more definition on the model''s dress.', '2004-07-06 14:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(797891, 86665, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice depth of field and exposure.  You caught a very expressive moment.  Your title should be tarred and feathered!</td>', 'Nice depth of field and exposure.  You caught a very expressive moment.  Your title should be tarred and feathered!', '2004-07-06 14:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(797892, 86285, 20210, '<td valign="top">I''m sure I''m saying the same thing many others have, but the blue border costs you at least a point in this challenge.  It''s quite distracting.  Also, I find the photo a bit soft to really show off the texture of the moon at this magnification.</td>', 'I''m sure I''m saying the same thing many others have, but the blue border costs you at least a point in this challenge.  It''s quite distracting.  Also, I find the photo a bit soft to really show off the texture of the moon at this magnification.', '2004-07-06 14:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(797894, 86285, 19608, '<td valign="top">Excellent lunar shot!  Exposure is perfect - composition is also very nice.  That ugly blue border should be launched into outer space - never to return!</td>', 'Excellent lunar shot!  Exposure is perfect - composition is also very nice.  That ugly blue border should be launched into outer space - never to return!', '2004-07-06 14:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(797896, 86488, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice composition - but I don''t think you really need the mirror/reflection for this.  I''d also rather see more side lighting as the glare on the golden egg does not help.  The feather at the bottom does not help the presentation.  Black background was a perfect choice.</td>', 'Nice composition - but I don''t think you really need the mirror/reflection for this.  I''d also rather see more side lighting as the glare on the golden egg does not help.  The feather at the bottom does not help the presentation.  Black background was a perfect choice.', '2004-07-06 14:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(797898, 85916, 19608, '<td valign="top">An architect with imagination!  Nice find and capture.  Imagine how well this would look with a decent sky.</td>', 'An architect with imagination!  Nice find and capture.  Imagine how well this would look with a decent sky.', '2004-07-06 14:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(797903, 85908, 19608, '<td valign="top">Good idea - and very nice submission.  It would be more effective if the hand were a bit lower so there was more obvious seperation.  Black background was a perfect choice.</td>', 'Good idea - and very nice submission.  It would be more effective if the hand were a bit lower so there was more obvious seperation.  Black background was a perfect choice.', '2004-07-06 14:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(797905, 86401, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and exposure.  This would also work for the color purple as you know.</td>', 'Nice composition and exposure.  This would also work for the color purple as you know.', '2004-07-06 14:51:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(797909, 86647, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and effective treeline silhouette (but a bit soft.)</td>', 'Nice colors and effective treeline silhouette (but a bit soft.)', '2004-07-06 14:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(797913, 86234, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great capture - placing the rainbow arch over the golf course and buldings works very well.</td>', 'Great capture - placing the rainbow arch over the golf course and buldings works very well.', '2004-07-06 14:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(797916, 86458, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very nice image and reflection.  The subtle colors are great.</td>', 'Very nice image and reflection.  The subtle colors are great.', '2004-07-06 14:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(797927, 85603, 11467, '<td valign="top">Excelent. Very well done.<br/>Maybe a flash would have helped to freeze the movement a bit better here, but I like the photo</td>', 'Excelent. Very well done.Maybe a flash would have helped to freeze the movement a bit better here, but I like the photo', '2004-07-06 15:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(797931, 86614, 11467, '<td valign="top">Love the colour &amp; composition here. Definitley a picture I coule see on the wall</td>', 'Love the colour & composition here. Definitley a picture I coule see on the wall', '2004-07-06 15:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(797933, 86317, 11467, '<td valign="top">Well spotted. quite extraordinary. Cropped pretty tight, might be more interesting with a bit more background to make it stand out even more.</td>', 'Well spotted. quite extraordinary. Cropped pretty tight, might be more interesting with a bit more background to make it stand out even more.', '2004-07-06 15:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(797934, 86482, 20066, '<td valign="top">This is very extraordinary I think.  And wel done...  gives an 8</td>', 'This is very extraordinary I think.  And wel done...  gives an 8', '2004-07-06 15:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(797936, 85946, 16488, '<td valign="top">It''s so exciting to see an interior shot of this building--and done so artistically, as well!  Hope to find more great shots of this building in your portfolio once the challenge closes.  Luck.</td>', 'It''s so exciting to see an interior shot of this building--and done so artistically, as well!  Hope to find more great shots of this building in your portfolio once the challenge closes.  Luck.', '2004-07-06 15:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(797938, 86488, 11467, '<td valign="top">Very good idea. <br/>Perhaps the reflection on the egg is a bit harsh, but due to my lack of eggsperience in such matters, can''t say how to eliminate it on such a difficult subject</td>', 'Very good idea. Perhaps the reflection on the egg is a bit harsh, but due to my lack of eggsperience in such matters, can''t say how to eliminate it on such a difficult subject', '2004-07-06 15:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(797939, 86211, 20066, '<td valign="top">Is this the new style of Canadian flag?<br/>Seems extraordinary</td>', 'Is this the new style of Canadian flag?Seems extraordinary', '2004-07-06 15:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(797941, 86405, 11467, '<td valign="top">Outstanding picture. Like the colour &amp; interesting image. Look foreward to seeing how it was done</td>', 'Outstanding picture. Like the colour & interesting image. Look foreward to seeing how it was done', '2004-07-06 15:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(797944, 85428, 16488, '<td valign="top">This is so richly textured in your post-processing!  Love the effect!  It seems it has enough contrast to carry off this technique.  The blue of the flower(?) next to it is a nice contrast, but I think the green in the corner detracts.  Nice, overall.</td>', 'This is so richly textured in your post-processing!  Love the effect!  It seems it has enough contrast to carry off this technique.  The blue of the flower(?) next to it is a nice contrast, but I think the green in the corner detracts.  Nice, overall.', '2004-07-06 15:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(797946, 86332, 11467, '<td valign="top">Interesting!! Light is perhaps a little harsh, but I like the colour, composition &amp; focus</td>', 'Interesting!! Light is perhaps a little harsh, but I like the colour, composition & focus', '2004-07-06 15:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
