(798262, 86341, 8860, '<td valign="top">A very clean shot considering how unclear the windows can be. A great scene and lovely DOF. I never really tire of the view from the skies. Even if I flew every day, it''s still better looking at this than gazing at the back of the seat in front!!</td>', 'A very clean shot considering how unclear the windows can be. A great scene and lovely DOF. I never really tire of the view from the skies. Even if I flew every day, it''s still better looking at this than gazing at the back of the seat in front!!', '2004-07-06 18:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(798263, 85523, 9668, '<td valign="top">The moth almost looks fake, how is it that big? Sharp focus on moth, blurry orange, interesting DOF. I think the composition could be a bit better, right now it is almost center, could be more towards one of the edges. Interesting shot.</td>', 'The moth almost looks fake, how is it that big? Sharp focus on moth, blurry orange, interesting DOF. I think the composition could be a bit better, right now it is almost center, could be more towards one of the edges. Interesting shot.', '2004-07-06 18:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(798274, 86583, 23737, '<td valign="top">Lovely contrast. Looking at the checks in her dress and the top of the grill to the fireplace helps to frame the reflection in the glass. And she is a darling little girl to boot...Great use of patterns to frame.</td>', 'Lovely contrast. Looking at the checks in her dress and the top of the grill to the fireplace helps to frame the reflection in the glass. And she is a darling little girl to boot...Great use of patterns to frame.', '2004-07-06 18:36:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(798276, 85518, 8860, '<td valign="top">I do feel that this is one of those shots that simply does not communicate the feeling of ''Extraordinary'' - certainly not without the title at the very least. In itself the subject is not out of the ordinary, although the fact that Reagan''s passing has led to a rare status for the flag may be ''unusual''.<br/> <br/>These issues aside it''s good DOF and quite clear, but the image holds too little interest to engage. Compsition is OK but a portrait arrangement may have been better to position the flag less centrally.</td>', 'I do feel that this is one of those shots that simply does not communicate the feeling of ''Extraordinary'' - certainly not without the title at the very least. In itself the subject is not out of the ordinary, although the fact that Reagan''s passing has led to a rare status for the flag may be ''unusual''. These issues aside it''s good DOF and quite clear, but the image holds too little interest to engage. Compsition is OK but a portrait arrangement may have been better to position the flag less centrally.', '2004-07-06 18:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(798283, 85644, 23737, '<td valign="top">I like the creativity. Nice photo. Simple, yet it has a feel of elegance.</td>', 'I like the creativity. Nice photo. Simple, yet it has a feel of elegance.', '2004-07-06 18:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(798284, 86477, 8860, '<td valign="top">Very odd indeed - and I can honestly say that I never knew this existed. That, is the simplest value of photography!<br/> <br/>The shot''s a little gloomy and flash-hot, but it does meet the challenge well.</td>', 'Very odd indeed - and I can honestly say that I never knew this existed. That, is the simplest value of photography! The shot''s a little gloomy and flash-hot, but it does meet the challenge well.', '2004-07-06 18:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(798286, 86502, 9668, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, not quite sure if it is extraordinary, but it is definatly a different type of photography. A kid in white shorts, holding up his hands, taken with a long exposure, with minor movement. I don''t know what to focus on, and it seems a bit blurry as well, but still quite interesting.</td>', 'Interesting shot, not quite sure if it is extraordinary, but it is definatly a different type of photography. A kid in white shorts, holding up his hands, taken with a long exposure, with minor movement. I don''t know what to focus on, and it seems a bit blurry as well, but still quite interesting.', '2004-07-06 18:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(798289, 86614, 8860, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, dynamic, unusual, weird, amazing, lush and very intriguing. I love nature and there''s seldom anything within her that is less than extraordinary.<br/> <br/>A wonderful [10]</td>', 'Beautiful, dynamic, unusual, weird, amazing, lush and very intriguing. I love nature and there''s seldom anything within her that is less than extraordinary. A wonderful [10]', '2004-07-06 18:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
