(798322, 86396, 9668, '<td valign="top">I like the expression the guy has, funny. Not sure what the story is behind this, but it would be quite interesting. I don''t see a stage in the scene, but anywhere could be a stage, you just need drama, which you''ve got here. Focus is good, background is distracting, the shadows/lightspots. But still a good capture of the moment.</td>', 'I like the expression the guy has, funny. Not sure what the story is behind this, but it would be quite interesting. I don''t see a stage in the scene, but anywhere could be a stage, you just need drama, which you''ve got here. Focus is good, background is distracting, the shadows/lightspots. But still a good capture of the moment.', '2004-07-06 19:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(798323, 85465, 8860, '<td valign="top">Such poise! This is exquisite beauty, very well shot. Wonderful, wonderful nature.</td>', 'Such poise! This is exquisite beauty, very well shot. Wonderful, wonderful nature.', '2004-07-06 19:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
