(798332, 86527, 8860, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot - very unusual choice. Very graphic and well focused. It''s just a shame that the reflection isn''t more meaningful. Don''t ask what it should be but it''s just a point! Love it.</td>', 'Excellent shot - very unusual choice. Very graphic and well focused. It''s just a shame that the reflection isn''t more meaningful. Don''t ask what it should be but it''s just a point! Love it.', '2004-07-06 19:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(798334, 86234, 15648, '<td valign="top">Needs a slight rotation.</td>', 'Needs a slight rotation.', '2004-07-06 19:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(798336, 86480, 18197, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic. I like the three layers of clouds. You had to be in just the right place at just the right time. As a pilot I am not bothered about the slanted horizon, but some may be. It may offend some people''s sense of gravity, but it works. Why is that? Good job. Among my top 5 picks. (8)</td>', 'Very dramatic. I like the three layers of clouds. You had to be in just the right place at just the right time. As a pilot I am not bothered about the slanted horizon, but some may be. It may offend some people''s sense of gravity, but it works. Why is that? Good job. Among my top 5 picks. (8)', '2004-07-06 19:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(798339, 86501, 9668, '<td valign="top">Beautiful place. Looks like you used dust and scratches filter, seems too soft to me. Nice composition and DOF.</td>', 'Beautiful place. Looks like you used dust and scratches filter, seems too soft to me. Nice composition and DOF.', '2004-07-06 19:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(798354, 86577, 9668, '<td valign="top">Not quite sure what is in the water. Some kind of fish? Why isn''t the focus on the dog instead of the water. What is that in the lower left corner. Nitpicky: chunk in the upper left corner. I don''t know why the title is in all caps, or why carefully is spelled wrong. It may be extraordinary in your mind, but I have a hard time seeing how it is. Interesting idea.</td>', 'Not quite sure what is in the water. Some kind of fish? Why isn''t the focus on the dog instead of the water. What is that in the lower left corner. Nitpicky: chunk in the upper left corner. I don''t know why the title is in all caps, or why carefully is spelled wrong. It may be extraordinary in your mind, but I have a hard time seeing how it is. Interesting idea.', '2004-07-06 19:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
