(798580, 86011, 23373, '<td valign="top">Powerful image. Wonder how this would look with the background tree a little more reduced f DOF??</td>', 'Powerful image. Wonder how this would look with the background tree a little more reduced f DOF??', '2004-07-06 21:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(798583, 86508, 23373, '<td valign="top">Like the crop.</td>', 'Like the crop.', '2004-07-06 21:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(798585, 86639, 23373, '<td valign="top">Love the tones but cropped a bit too tight on the top. from my perspective.</td>', 'Love the tones but cropped a bit too tight on the top. from my perspective.', '2004-07-06 21:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(798587, 86032, 23373, '<td valign="top">Clever image</td>', 'Clever image', '2004-07-06 21:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(798589, 86634, 7560, '<td valign="top">This is one of my 2 10s in this challenge. I love the choice of black and white. The way both subjects appear to be looking in the opposite direction drew me in. I love the fact that the boxer looks like he''s trying to check in on the kitten. )  I''d like to see this one in color.</td>', 'This is one of my 2 10s in this challenge. I love the choice of black and white. The way both subjects appear to be looking in the opposite direction drew me in. I love the fact that the boxer looks like he''s trying to check in on the kitten. )  I''d like to see this one in color.', '2004-07-06 21:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(798592, 86211, 7560, '<td valign="top">Crazy Canucks! One of my two 10s for the challenge. I love the color contrast I''d make a minor cropping change and lose the tree. Just for visual impact- this is great.</td>', 'Crazy Canucks! One of my two 10s for the challenge. I love the color contrast I''d make a minor cropping change and lose the tree. Just for visual impact- this is great.', '2004-07-06 21:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(798596, 86426, 23373, '<td valign="top">Might have been more powerful if the cross was in perfect DOF</td>', 'Might have been more powerful if the cross was in perfect DOF', '2004-07-06 21:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(798598, 85863, 7560, '<td valign="top">Right time, right place. Looks like a bit of a focus issue, or just slight softeness from the lens choice. As a cycling fan, I just enjoyed this particular capture. :) 9</td>', 'Right time, right place. Looks like a bit of a focus issue, or just slight softeness from the lens choice. As a cycling fan, I just enjoyed this particular capture. :) 9', '2004-07-06 21:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(798602, 86458, 7560, '<td valign="top">Very, very cool. Great as a thumbnail, great up close. I''d like to see it in a better light. That;s the only technical comment I have. 10</td>', 'Very, very cool. Great as a thumbnail, great up close. I''d like to see it in a better light. That;s the only technical comment I have. 10', '2004-07-06 21:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(798605, 86285, 23373, '<td valign="top">find the blue border distracting.  Might want to show less moon &amp; more black background</td>', 'find the blue border distracting.  Might want to show less moon & more black background', '2004-07-06 21:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(798606, 86689, 7560, '<td valign="top">Not in and of itself an extraordinary event, but a very difficult shot to capture. Not sure if I like the addition of the fingertip or not. But it''s a very strong image. 8</td>', 'Not in and of itself an extraordinary event, but a very difficult shot to capture. Not sure if I like the addition of the fingertip or not. But it''s a very strong image. 8', '2004-07-06 21:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(798607, 85389, 23373, '<td valign="top">would have preferre all 4 subjects to be totally in DOF</td>', 'would have preferre all 4 subjects to be totally in DOF', '2004-07-06 21:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(798612, 86230, 7560, '<td valign="top">Having just spent some time in a forrest where you have this kind of streaming light, I have a new appreciation for how challenging it is to get a pretty light shot like this that tells a story. Very good eye. 8</td>', 'Having just spent some time in a forrest where you have this kind of streaming light, I have a new appreciation for how challenging it is to get a pretty light shot like this that tells a story. Very good eye. 8', '2004-07-06 21:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(798616, 86480, 7560, '<td valign="top">Many people think cloud shots are boring. I disagree. I love this. I love the shading on the clouds, and the color. 7</td>', 'Many people think cloud shots are boring. I disagree. I love this. I love the shading on the clouds, and the color. 7', '2004-07-06 21:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(798623, 85937, 7560, '<td valign="top">I''m looking forward to seeing how you did this shot. It''s very US centric even without the flag. The Purple Heart feels a bit 2d in this shot, and with the US flag, it gives a feeling tha tthe shot is out of focus. The left edge of the medal also looks a bit oversharp? Not sure if that''s an optical trick or not.  8 for having the rare well executed Patriotic shot. :)</td>', 'I''m looking forward to seeing how you did this shot. It''s very US centric even without the flag. The Purple Heart feels a bit 2d in this shot, and with the US flag, it gives a feeling tha tthe shot is out of focus. The left edge of the medal also looks a bit oversharp? Not sure if that''s an optical trick or not.  8 for having the rare well executed Patriotic shot. :)', '2004-07-06 21:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(798626, 86484, 7560, '<td valign="top">Who the heck needed you to validate this shot? THis is a great capture! I love the emotion on the boy''s face. The balance is a bit off, but that''s probably due to shooting without being able to frame. Congrats on what was probably a very, very tricky shot. :) 8</td>', 'Who the heck needed you to validate this shot? THis is a great capture! I love the emotion on the boy''s face. The balance is a bit off, but that''s probably due to shooting without being able to frame. Congrats on what was probably a very, very tricky shot. :) 8', '2004-07-06 21:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(798630, 86335, 7560, '<td valign="top">I love this shot. I''m a sucker for the colors you get with the mountains and the pueblos. The dog really makes the shot for me. 8</td>', 'I love this shot. I''m a sucker for the colors you get with the mountains and the pueblos. The dog really makes the shot for me. 8', '2004-07-06 21:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(798636, 86750, 7560, '<td valign="top">With any inanimate object, you have to tell a story. In this case the artistic decisions you''ve made make it challenging at best for me to understand the story. I''m a big fan of shallow DOF. In this shot it doesn''t really add to anything, and it actually distracts from a potentially good shot. I''d shift the angle a bit to get more of a head on shot. Lose the pin on the left since it''s not telling the story. COnsider adding a photo of the recipient if possible. Put a face on the story. Use an old CG uniform as the backdrop? The lighting also has a very amber cast to it. You might want to check your white balance and make some adjustments.</td>', 'With any inanimate object, you have to tell a story. In this case the artistic decisions you''ve made make it challenging at best for me to understand the story. I''m a big fan of shallow DOF. In this shot it doesn''t really add to anything, and it actually distracts from a potentially good shot. I''d shift the angle a bit to get more of a head on shot. Lose the pin on the left since it''s not telling the story. COnsider adding a photo of the recipient if possible. Put a face on the story. Use an old CG uniform as the backdrop? The lighting also has a very amber cast to it. You might want to check your white balance and make some adjustments.', '2004-07-06 22:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(798641, 86533, 7560, '<td valign="top">Pet pictures are tough. The first thing I try and do is get on the level of the pet. Get on your belly and try shooting from the dog''s POV. I''d also shoot in later afternoon or early in the morning. Mid-day is harsh and it will wash out your images.</td>', 'Pet pictures are tough. The first thing I try and do is get on the level of the pet. Get on your belly and try shooting from the dog''s POV. I''d also shoot in later afternoon or early in the morning. Mid-day is harsh and it will wash out your images.', '2004-07-06 22:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(798643, 86029, 15242, '<td valign="top">Long exposure on a camp fire?  Looks like it was a little too long.  The result isn''t very pleasing and the photo is quite noisy.</td>', 'Long exposure on a camp fire?  Looks like it was a little too long.  The result isn''t very pleasing and the photo is quite noisy.', '2004-07-06 22:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(798645, 85452, 15242, '<td valign="top">You need a faster shutter to catch this shot.  It could have been pretty good.  Also, why didn''t you crop out the bottom.</td>', 'You need a faster shutter to catch this shot.  It could have been pretty good.  Also, why didn''t you crop out the bottom.', '2004-07-06 22:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(798646, 86502, 15242, '<td valign="top">Nothing really extraordinary here</td>', 'Nothing really extraordinary here', '2004-07-06 22:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(798653, 85606, 15242, '<td valign="top">Wow, pretty place.  Where is it?</td>', 'Wow, pretty place.  Where is it?', '2004-07-06 22:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(798664, 86150, 15242, '<td valign="top">Cute photo but it doesn''t say extraordinarywithout the title</td>', 'Cute photo but it doesn''t say extraordinarywithout the title', '2004-07-06 22:31:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(798667, 86561, 15242, '<td valign="top">Why so small?  What''s extraordinary?</td>', 'Why so small?  What''s extraordinary?', '2004-07-06 22:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(798671, 86223, 15242, '<td valign="top">WHat is suppose to be extraordinary here?  Looks pretty ordinary to me.</td>', 'WHat is suppose to be extraordinary here?  Looks pretty ordinary to me.', '2004-07-06 22:36:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(798673, 86612, 15242, '<td valign="top">I don''t get how the title goes with the picture.  Did someone beat her up because the TV broke?</td>', 'I don''t get how the title goes with the picture.  Did someone beat her up because the TV broke?', '2004-07-06 22:37:54.000000', NULL, 1);
