(798674, 85664, 15242, '<td valign="top">It''s a pretty plain old snap shot of some waves.  With the sun glare, it''s not even very well taken.</td>', 'It''s a pretty plain old snap shot of some waves.  With the sun glare, it''s not even very well taken.', '2004-07-06 22:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
