(798767, 86651, 23554, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful setup! It looks like an ad for the wine.</td>', 'What a beautiful setup! It looks like an ad for the wine.', '2004-07-06 23:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(798768, 86621, 18068, '<td valign="top">I was down by the lake shore on my birthday when i saw this, truly extraordinary, ;) <br/></td>', 'I was down by the lake shore on my birthday when i saw this, truly extraordinary, ;) ', '2004-07-06 23:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(798769, 86407, 23554, '<td valign="top">I like where you cropped this so that the picture is flooded with the peacock''s colors. I sort of like the way the background is darker on the right too because it shows what his feathers look like against a light and dark backdrop.</td>', 'I like where you cropped this so that the picture is flooded with the peacock''s colors. I sort of like the way the background is darker on the right too because it shows what his feathers look like against a light and dark backdrop.', '2004-07-06 23:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(798770, 85916, 23554, '<td valign="top">Wow, I''ve never seen anything like this! Good idea for a shot.</td>', 'Wow, I''ve never seen anything like this! Good idea for a shot.', '2004-07-06 23:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(798773, 86488, 23554, '<td valign="top">I love the idea of putting the subject on a mirrored bottom, it adds more depth to the picture. Glad the feather is in there too, wouldn''t have been the same without it</td>', 'I love the idea of putting the subject on a mirrored bottom, it adds more depth to the picture. Glad the feather is in there too, wouldn''t have been the same without it', '2004-07-06 23:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(798774, 86332, 23554, '<td valign="top">Bright white of the wall is distracting, maybe if it had been done on a different background, possibly where you can see the sky so it looks like he''s flying through it. Good idea for the shot though.<br/> <br/>Also it looks like he''s touching the wall because of the shadow, maybe get him further away from it.</td>', 'Bright white of the wall is distracting, maybe if it had been done on a different background, possibly where you can see the sky so it looks like he''s flying through it. Good idea for the shot though. Also it looks like he''s touching the wall because of the shadow, maybe get him further away from it.', '2004-07-06 23:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(798776, 86451, 23554, '<td valign="top">Nice take on something so natural.</td>', 'Nice take on something so natural.', '2004-07-06 23:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(798777, 86415, 23554, '<td valign="top">Those are beautiful, I love photographing cathedrals and churches around here because they are so intricate. The shadows at the top of the spires start to kill the warm mood of the photo though.</td>', 'Those are beautiful, I love photographing cathedrals and churches around here because they are so intricate. The shadows at the top of the spires start to kill the warm mood of the photo though.', '2004-07-06 23:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
