(798830, 86501, 21611, '<td valign="top">A very nice picture. good dof and colors keeping the path in the shot is a nice touch. Sorry, but it does not say extraordinary to me yet I do like the shot 7</td>', 'A very nice picture. good dof and colors keeping the path in the shot is a nice touch. Sorry, but it does not say extraordinary to me yet I do like the shot 7', '2004-07-07 00:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(798833, 86612, 21611, '<td valign="top">Please tell me its staged. Vey realistic and the shot is extraordinary yet it unnerves me (and others I am sure). You cant help looking at a car wreck. Why such a tight crop on top? The subject moves me to a 7</td>', 'Please tell me its staged. Vey realistic and the shot is extraordinary yet it unnerves me (and others I am sure). You cant help looking at a car wreck. Why such a tight crop on top? The subject moves me to a 7', '2004-07-07 00:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(798837, 85389, 21611, '<td valign="top">I bet they are!  The top subject should have been the focal point and thus should have had the sharpest focus. IMO. I do like the shot. I know others will beat you up for it being ordinary to them. well done</td>', 'I bet they are!  The top subject should have been the focal point and thus should have had the sharpest focus. IMO. I do like the shot. I know others will beat you up for it being ordinary to them. well done', '2004-07-07 00:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
