(799617, 86159, 7810, '<td valign="top">Hi John:<br/> <br/>Awesome shot!!  congrats on your top ten finish.  Last weekend I sat by our humming bird feeder at the cottage, lens up for about an hour waiting for a shot. I finally gave up as no birds showed up. With camera back in bag, I walked back up to the cottage. Turning around for one final look, guess what was feeding at the trough. :(<br/> <br/>Again congrats, great capture<br/> <br/>Coley<br/> <br/>Congrats on your first ribbon!!!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-07-11 22:36:40.</i></td>', 'Hi John: Awesome shot!!  congrats on your top ten finish.  Last weekend I sat by our humming bird feeder at the cottage, lens up for about an hour waiting for a shot. I finally gave up as no birds showed up. With camera back in bag, I walked back up to the cottage. Turning around for one final look, guess what was feeding at the trough. :( Again congrats, great capture Coley Congrats on your first ribbon!!!', '2004-07-07 06:39:59.000000', '2004-07-11 23:36:40.000000', 0),
