(799825, 86516, 15407, '<td valign="top">My friend ~ extrodinary!    You know that I am a Keltic ... and a Motorcyclist... to that end - there is not a more extrodnary ''venue'' than the Isle of Mann. I gave this a 10 because of all of the qualities this image represents and I hope to have the opportunity to enter the ''Extrodinary revisited'' challenge sometime in the future... I may not make it ''til 2007 yet I will make it there and be sure to pay my respects at the bridge! CONGRATULATIONS on making this picture happen... I love it &amp; it is an excellent picture ... very much appreciated by me !</td>', 'My friend ~ extrodinary!    You know that I am a Keltic ... and a Motorcyclist... to that end - there is not a more extrodnary ''venue'' than the Isle of Mann. I gave this a 10 because of all of the qualities this image represents and I hope to have the opportunity to enter the ''Extrodinary revisited'' challenge sometime in the future... I may not make it ''til 2007 yet I will make it there and be sure to pay my respects at the bridge! CONGRATULATIONS on making this picture happen... I love it & it is an excellent picture ... very much appreciated by me !', '2004-07-07 09:50:54.000000', NULL, 0),
