(799903, 86612, 16488, '<td valign="top">I will say I''m relieved to learn that this challenge entry was staged.  But it''s so well done, it''s still disturbing to think how many times a day it''s all too real to so many women!<br/> <br/>A powerful and appropriate way to reach beyond the "pretty picture" syndrome.  You''ve presented a powerful portrait with beautiful depth.  I hope you might be able to make good use of it since it conveys a message that needs so much to be heard.</td>', 'I will say I''m relieved to learn that this challenge entry was staged.  But it''s so well done, it''s still disturbing to think how many times a day it''s all too real to so many women! A powerful and appropriate way to reach beyond the "pretty picture" syndrome.  You''ve presented a powerful portrait with beautiful depth.  I hope you might be able to make good use of it since it conveys a message that needs so much to be heard.', '2004-07-07 11:08:04.000000', NULL, 0),
