(801582, 86567, 10818, '<td valign="top">Sorry this placed so low, I just dont think most people knew his story, and what he has gone through.  Fantastic photo, and its remarkable he has raced after the horrible accident.</td>', 'Sorry this placed so low, I just dont think most people knew his story, and what he has gone through.  Fantastic photo, and its remarkable he has raced after the horrible accident.', '2004-07-08 00:52:42.000000', NULL, 0),
