(803169, 86614, 16488, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Thank you Brad!  I was really pleased with my entry and happy so many others liked it.  I''m afraid my challenge work runs hot and cold at the moment.<br/> <br/>I should clear up the name thing.  (I entirely forgot what was in my profile or I would have changed it if I thought I''d make the top 10.)  Lily is the name of one of my cats, her brother is Tiger.  I like to mess around with my profile name so this week I''m "Lily Meister".  That replaced "Thread Killer" once I stopped killing all the threads I spoke to .  Who knows what it''ll be next week...  But I''ll stick with KaDi here, if you don''t mind.</td>', 'Wow!  Thank you Brad!  I was really pleased with my entry and happy so many others liked it.  I''m afraid my challenge work runs hot and cold at the moment. I should clear up the name thing.  (I entirely forgot what was in my profile or I would have changed it if I thought I''d make the top 10.)  Lily is the name of one of my cats, her brother is Tiger.  I like to mess around with my profile name so this week I''m "Lily Meister".  That replaced "Thread Killer" once I stopped killing all the threads I spoke to .  Who knows what it''ll be next week...  But I''ll stick with KaDi here, if you don''t mind.', '2004-07-08 22:54:41.000000', NULL, 0),
