(904913, 86554, 3214, '<td valign="top">It was a poor choice for the challenge--what was extraordinary is not apparent to non-horse people.  It was so hot that you could see her black skin through her grey (white) hair around her muzzle and eyes, and I thought the shadow was appealing.  Thanks for looking and commenting...her sepia gallery is at <a href="//www.photo.lynnesite.com/gallery/143639" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.photo.lynnesite.com/gallery/143639</a> <br/>Lynne</td>', 'It was a poor choice for the challenge--what was extraordinary is not apparent to non-horse people.  It was so hot that you could see her black skin through her grey (white) hair around her muzzle and eyes, and I thought the shadow was appealing.  Thanks for looking and commenting...her sepia gallery is at //www.photo.lynnesite.com/gallery/143639 Lynne', '2004-09-11 17:42:14.000000', NULL, 0),
