(1002260, 86518, 10084, '<td valign="top">The miracle of birth. One of the most extraordinary times in one life. Very dramatic lighting. I like some of the shadows that shows the wrinkleness of newborns. Very effective.</td>', 'The miracle of birth. One of the most extraordinary times in one life. Very dramatic lighting. I like some of the shadows that shows the wrinkleness of newborns. Very effective.', '2004-11-09 23:53:31.000000', NULL, 0),
