(1614105, 86490, 30507, '<td valign="top">Wonderful point of view. I only see one thing wrong (I do know it''s not your fault). Lights turn into purple with 4 colour CCD in your F828. It''s very common in this camera when light sources are brighter than we expect. I only notice that fact in the upper left. Nice work</td>', 'Wonderful point of view. I only see one thing wrong (I do know it''s not your fault). Lights turn into purple with 4 colour CCD in your F828. It''s very common in this camera when light sources are brighter than we expect. I only notice that fact in the upper left. Nice work', '2005-08-16 07:29:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(1782985, 86615, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is great.  I was there this summer, as my sister lives in L.A. and it''s amazing all of the colorful surroundings and people.  You captured this guy so well. I''d like to see a zoom in maybe, less of the background and more of him.</td>', 'This is great.  I was there this summer, as my sister lives in L.A. and it''s amazing all of the colorful surroundings and people.  You captured this guy so well. I''d like to see a zoom in maybe, less of the background and more of him.', '2005-10-13 23:18:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(1835539, 86129, 4285, '<td valign="top">I love doing night shots.  I think this is great.  The only thing I would have probably done differently is try and shoot without the foreground elements, maybe move closer to the railing (or whatever) and try and capture the reflection more.  FWIW, it can''t believe this only got 5.9 and some imbeciles actually gave it 1s and 2s.<br/> <br/>Owen</td>', 'I love doing night shots.  I think this is great.  The only thing I would have probably done differently is try and shoot without the foreground elements, maybe move closer to the railing (or whatever) and try and capture the reflection more.  FWIW, it can''t believe this only got 5.9 and some imbeciles actually gave it 1s and 2s. Owen', '2005-11-03 09:42:34.000000', NULL, 0),
